ame CRUD on local workerd, and the built wheel bundles all template\nfiles and runs via uvx. CI generates every template and runs its suite\non each push.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7995c92f3aa0a0093ee2a7510d39a0957850cc1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hayatepy/create-hayate/git/trees/7995c92f3aa0a0093ee2a7510d39a0957850cc1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hayatepy/create-hayate/git/commits/59209622404123024f926b9552de9a6dd76d4277","verification":{"payload":"tree 7995c92f3aa0a0093ee2a7510d39a0957850cc1d\nparent cc9d242af457c810bae5fdde97fb278b17d023bc\nauthor yusuke8h <yusuke8h@gmail.com> 1784724994 +0900\ncommitter yusuke8h <yusuke8h@gmail.com> 1784724994 +0900\n\nImplement v0.1: api and workers templates, zero-dependency CLI\n\nuvx create-hayate my-app scaffolds a tested TODO API from bundled\ntemplates (argparse + string.Template, stdlib only). Both templates\nshare the same runtime-agnostic app.py; the workers variant adds the\nwrangler config and adapter entry.\n\nVerified end to end: generated projects pass their own pytest, the api\ntemplate serves CRUD under uvicorn, the workers template serves the\nsame CRUD on local workerd, and the built wheel bundles all template\nfiles and runs via uvx. CI generates every template and runs its suite\non each push.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQQTeKnhRFkiLRLD0utCTli3pFMH/gUCamC+AhsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwyLDEACgkQQk5Yt6RTB/7eHwD+MlokWpwTpdKaazsPJd0X\n9QRLKuQQM9qQ7nwoDr92zR0A/jctOarZPQWLujfrbiIVPLUl7wAFQNd7NKjquUXt\nLLIA\n=PK4y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-22T12:56:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11132792?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yhay81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yhay81/followers","following_url":"https://ap