ngwei-chai-aq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jingwei-chai-aq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jingwei-chai-aq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jingwei-chai-aq/fe-course/commits/da00e12628ef5e41759fcbc38374efc80f197d9e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T02:34:19Z","email":"jingwei.chai@aquariux.com","name":"jingwei.chai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T02:34:19Z","email":"jingwei.chai@aquariux.com","name":"jingwei.chai"},"message":"Redesign UI: code-hero layout + Apple-craft polish\n\n- Playground is now the hero: wide (60% editor) and tall (560px) dark editor\n  on the light page — strong figure/ground pull to the code, since the deck\n  carries the explanation.\n- Hands-on lessons: thin lead line → full-width playground → callout chip row.\n  Concept lessons keep the readable prose column.\n- Widened main content (maxw 1500), softer radii + layered shadows, translucent\n  sticky rail, size-specific type (tight heading tracking), reduced-motion and\n  reduced-transparency support.\n- More hands-on: added live playgrounds to DOM, CSS-cascade, and \"What is React\"\n  lessons; upgraded components/props to a real multi-file parent/child split.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017h5wNS1ywTL6SPaQt9SA27","tree":{"sha":"f0228be2c4639083029d55c374c7ca3d6c4116f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jingwei-chai-aq/fe-course/git/trees/f0228be2c4639083029d55c374c7ca3d6c4116f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jingwei-chai-aq/fe-course/git/commits/da00e12628ef5e41759fcbc38374efc80f197d9e","verification":{"payload":"tree f0228be2c4639083029d55c374c7ca3d6c4116f3\nparent 6d16d8d2f3a56d914ce3fbb13f7f58fb4261c98f\nauthor jingwei.chai <jingwei.chai@aquariux.com> 1784687659 +0800\ncommitter jingwei.chai <jingwei.chai@aquariux.com> 1784687659 +0800\n\