gDODWthFA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jingwei-chai-aq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jingwei-chai-aq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jingwei-chai-aq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jingwei-chai-aq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jingwei-chai-aq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jingwei-chai-aq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jingwei-chai-aq/fe-course/commits/6d16d8d2f3a56d914ce3fbb13f7f58fb4261c98f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T02:05:13Z","email":"jingwei.chai@aquariux.com","name":"jingwei.chai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T02:05:13Z","email":"jingwei.chai@aquariux.com","name":"jingwei.chai"},"message":"Scaffold Frontend-from-Zero interactive course monorepo\n\npnpm-workspaces monorepo mirroring the aqx-member reference repo, teaching\nParts 1-3 of the onboarding deck with in-browser (Sandpack) playgrounds.\n\n- @fe-course/core: Model types + MVVM progress service (Service/Controller/Hook\n  via react-reservice) + 31 lessons ported from the deck\n- @fe-course/web: Vite + React 19 app — router, rail, playground engine, callouts\n- @fe-course/watchlist-{core,web}: one worked feature, core/web split, as the\n  Part-3 \"one brain, two faces\" example\n\nVerified: tsc clean across all packages, vite build (109 modules) green,\nprettier clean, MVVM Service+Controller runtime smoke test passes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017h5wNS1ywTL6SPaQt9SA27","tree":{"sha":"d6e871260bcf5b25b76fe4479baeda88006c710f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jingwei-chai-aq/fe-course/git/trees/d6e871260bcf5b25b76fe4479baeda88006c710f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jingwei-chai-aq/fe-course/git/commits/6d16d8d2f3a56d914ce3fbb13f7f58fb4261c98f","verification":{"payload":"tree d6e871260bcf5b25b76fe4479baeda88006c710f\nauthor jingwei.chai <jingwei.chai@aquariux.com> 1784685913 +0800\ncommitter jingwei.chai <jingwei.chai@aquariux.com> 1784685913 +0800\n\nScaffold Frontend-from-Zero interactive course monorepo\n\npnpm-workspaces monorepo mirroring the aqx-member reference repo, teaching\nParts 1-3 of the onboarding deck with in-browser (Sandpack) playgrounds.\n\n- @fe-course/core: Model types + MVVM progress service (Service/Controller/Hook\n  via react-reservice) + 31 lessons ported from the deck\n- @fe-course/web: Vite + React 19 app — router, rail, playground engine, callouts\n- @fe-course/watchlist-{core,web}: one worked feature, core/web split, as the\n  Part-3 \"one brain, two faces\" example\n\nVerified: tsc clean across all packages, vite build (109 modules) green,\nprettier clean, MVVM Service+Controller runtime smoke test passes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017h5wNS1ywTL6SPaQt9SA27\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEnxJJrBi8AMgin5Ab1gUzc1+KrHwFAmpgJVkbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJENYFM3Nfiqx8gvQQAK/Agwyg9PPkn/5BNvBN\nHnSLUayLW0GGAL8PdrJuo1sMW5Lx4szdi6w9bl1YGDB8sqL7yi99XbxAQYtuGcr0\n2/3+KFMLhrVyMA7T4AuUwnwyw0/YiYN7s7fR17/HIjf3f4xkoDeZU5mzP7fjfu6n\n0AVTyoiKCTSatxsT4ACudLEEYIeeJpjhfupD/ZMkmJWp53wDVzBT4UiDN7Ru00rB\nbkkFcX7xzDl3C60Fqu7WTWCFDoKbuF98uJIHbMv5Ev3ws9G6SUUsl0+zGZ1SCStz\nuOGgFu7zdsv1znMOX4CR2VJesf3815ZC2X7uNptI223hT9Muo+6VMPaoziRTmT28\nBsuqx8xyUnEqsU/BrpibKHtiWtM7yxZ75v13gF5yKZpusMUAATLtCMbMlbPZU6R9\nnbMG5XsY9kNm2w8ZUGSlwQIKoTlAvP99d9VjF6RlDcAkcmtHVMgzrv2eHXEMoo03\nVU9GaXG12125fdC2aQp9/nYG50xqrY18FK6L74hh0woSkKRLqP27Y+QAz1+lWdTd\nfAX2CNvdGZxCKjrJZfKmXvMQXW5zzsadpl4dS1GbMpHYy9n9cp0+vHQ7hY29+AWz\n53cEejriqLK90ERtpYC4KgewTCPJctABrvPUFk9Qqla7q5sPqmbYFABDKOr2ELNC\nvIsSfILpAVXGMQfJunmYjebW\n=yzBE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verifi