":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/commits/0a247d0677ab77ce6d94ad2e4b02bfcc034c9e49/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T22:44:15Z","email":"m4rt1ns.jose@gmail.com","name":"Eduardo Martins"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T22:44:15Z","email":"m4rt1ns.jose@gmail.com","name":"Eduardo Martins"},"message":"feat: track animated anchors for tooltip and spotlight\n\nThe tooltip and spotlight were measured once, too early, when the target was\nstill mid enter-animation. A CSS `transform` (e.g. a drawer sliding in) does not\nchange the border-box, so ResizeObserver stays silent and no scroll/resize\nfires — the tooltip anchored to the target''s off-screen start position (then got\nshoved back into view by shift/flip) and the spotlight cut its hole off-screen,\nleaving the whole overlay dark.\n\n- useFloatingStep: wrap `autoUpdate` with `{ animationFrame: true }` so Floating\n  UI re-measures the reference every frame while mounted; the tooltip now glides\n  in with an animating anchor.\n- useElementRect: add a short rAF poll that re-measures while the rect keeps\n  moving and stops after it holds still for a few frames (re-armed by the\n  existing observers). The spotlight now follows a transform-animated target.\n\nCovered by a new useFloatingStep test (asserts the animationFrame wiring) and a\nuseElementRect test that drives requestAnimationFrame by hand to prove a rect\nmoving via transform is tracked and the poll stops once it settles.","tree":{"sha":"d3dddd28116871064769f929d633a14834cc0347","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/git/trees/d3dddd28116871064769f929d633a14834cc0347"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/git/commits/0a247d0677ab77ce6d94ad2e4b02bfcc034c9e49","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49596282?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoseEduardoMartins","id":49596282,"login":"JoseEduardoMartins","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NTk2Mjgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/commit/0a247d0677ab77ce6d94ad2e4b02bfcc034c9e49","node_id":"C_kwDOTgN3OdoAKDBhMjQ3ZDA2NzdhYjc3Y2U2ZDk0YWQyZTRiMDJiZmNjMDM0YzllNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/commit/fc65282ce4d4db005a1eb42c82e0c143d6f757de","sha":"fc65282ce4d4db005a1eb42c82e0c143d6f757de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/commits/fc65282ce4d4db005a1eb42c82e0c143d6f757de"}],"sha":"0a247d0677ab77ce6d94ad2e4b02bfcc034c9e49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/commits/0a247d0677ab77ce6d94ad2e4b02bfcc034c9e49"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32174276?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_