ement registry ([84392c9](https://github.com/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/commit/84392c92d075fad30c4880841c09c166c1c39f48))\n* **core:** generic register, store teardown, and overwrite warning ([aadcc6b](https://github.com/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/commit/aadcc6b5ec8edf0b9e31e0997652a98f3fcf3b85))\n* **core:** navigation helpers and flow guards ([652bd48](https://github.com/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/commit/652bd48af056b6958828973d9c620721c7967f73))\n* **core:** persistence adapters ([3240328](https://github.com/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/commit/32403284f7150e6b5d9aaeb721ba5a756633d838))\n* **core:** tutorial store, factory and core barrel ([76810d9](https://github.com/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/commit/76810d906ae6065be17bb808e1a6e52734e4843c))\n* **core:** typed event emitter ([8dc78f9](https://github.com/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/commit/8dc78f9da73624bdbe368381049cac7c1288c429))\n* **examples:** multi-page tour with React Router ([3def0a9](https://github.com/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/commit/3def0a9b4c06b082b9ad704eb447b3f1af7a0099))\n* public package barrel ([731b404](https://github.com/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/commit/731b4044cfe5a01b1f812ee543c36c52ab2e1b75))\n* **react:** data-tutorial-id scan mode ([98aebc9](https://github.com/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/commit/98aebc931bcebd77c7bd1a41baf26fa5707580f5))\n* **react:** default slots — overlay, spotlight, tooltip ([96d57db](https://github.com/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/commit/96d57db95c127ba0cabc560e9ad3a1080832ddee))\n* **react:** DOM hooks for positioning, scroll and focus ([e8bce95](https://github.com/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/commit/e8bce95527eb2324aa0f036e313685358bdba9a6))\n* **react:** public hooks ([2e2acf7](https://github.com/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/commit/2e2acf7e261485f3af6f9bc9b069e47a9bb4b8c6))\n* **react:** resolved config context ([e27e6d9](https://github.com/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/commi