:{"date":"2026-07-24T02:00:19Z","email":"m4rt1ns.jose@gmail.com","name":"Eduardo Martins"},"message":"ci(release): drop npm provenance/OIDC for token-based publishing\n\nRemove NPM_CONFIG_PROVENANCE and the id-token permission so the release\npublishes purely via NPM_TOKEN (as the reference repo does), avoiding the\nfailing OIDC token exchange. Provenance can return later via npm Trusted\nPublishing once the package exists.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"182d6021ff5a136c0c07db7d0cb9b60b9188a223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/git/trees/182d6021ff5a136c0c07db7d0cb9b60b9188a223"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/git/commits/0df14649051a9a2215ab81754b4224ccdcca5cfd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49596282?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoseEduardoMartins","id":49596282,"login":"JoseEduardoMartins","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NTk2Mjgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://g