6-07-24T02:00:19Z","email":"m4rt1ns.jose@gmail.com","name":"Eduardo Martins"},"message":"ci(release): authenticate npm via committed .npmrc\n\nactions/setup-node''s generated .npmrc authenticates with ${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN},\nwhich is never set, so npm fell back to no auth and 401''d on whoami even with a\nvalid NPM_TOKEN. A project-level .npmrc reading ${NPM_TOKEN} takes precedence\nand fixes authentication. Mirrors the fast-food-design-system setup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb44bced239e1b5001b6bbc2267bacbd3ba276ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/git/trees/fb44bced239e1b5001b6bbc2267bacbd3ba276ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoseEduardoMartins/react-step-flow/git/commits/c21fa454ce9ce6e66633ca736ed0cc9c5185ef70","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49596282?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoseEduardoMartins","id":49596282,"login":"JoseEduardoMartins","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NTk2Mjgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseEduardoMartins","user_view_type":"public