m/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/cd72ebc3aa62b7db40d27fe60339738070ddd324/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:25:53Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:25:53Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"v0.12.0: named actuators with icons + actuator rows in the scheduler widget\n\nFeedback: actuator schedule windows (waterfall, stream, aerator, …) can\nnow be named and given an icon, and are shown in the PumpScheduler widget.\n\n- schedule.ts (mirrored): PumpSchedule +actuatorName/actuatorIcon;\n  new describeActuators(plans, nowMin, astro) → [{name, icon, target, on}]\n  (name falls back to \"Aktor N\"), unit-tested (124 passing).\n- Admin scheduler editor: actuator windows gained a Name field\n  (placeholder \"Actuator N\") and an emoji Icon picker (waterfall, stream,\n  aerator/oxygen pump, air, spray, UV, light, feeder, plant, heater,\n  chiller, …). +admin i18n \"Actuator name\"/\"Icon\" (11 languages).\n- Backend: new read-only pumps.<n>.schedule.actuators JSON state\n  (role \"json\"), published each tick from describeActuators.\n- PumpScheduler widget: lists each actuator ABOVE the telemetry, one row\n  as \"icon — name — wheel\"; the wheel is a small light-green impeller that\n  spins (optionally animated) while on and stands still (dimmed) while off.\n- graphics.tsx: renderImpeller now takes an endColor and uses a unique\n  gradient id per colour pair — fixes a latent id collision so the hero\n  (blue) and actuator (green) impellers on one card keep their own colour.\n\nHandbook DE+EN 9.4 note; PDFs regenerated. README + news (11 languages).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1125d4511fb36fcac2947923501dd208d446dbf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/1125d4511fb36fcac2947923501dd208d446dbf9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/cd72ebc3aa62b7db40d27fe60339738070ddd324","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/cd72ebc3aa62b7db40d27fe60339738070ddd324","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKGNkNzJlYmMzYWE2MmI3ZGI0MGQyN2ZlNjAzMzk3MzgwNzBkZGQzMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/a20bb7b8b414664a69f1f585b186f22be2203c65","sha":"a20bb7b8b414664a69f1f585b186f22be2203c65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/a20bb7b8b414664a69f1f585b186f22be2203c65"}],"sha":"cd72ebc3aa62b7db40d27fe60339738070ddd324","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/cd72ebc3aa62b7db40d27fe60339738070ddd324"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/a20bb7b8b414664a69f1f585b186f22be2203c65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:50:32Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:50:32Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"v0.11.1: widget refinements (thermometer size, scheduler impeller + water temp, robust reads)\n\nFeedback from live testing:\n- PumpVisual: the water thermometer was far too large. Replaced with a\n  slim, modern, colour-coded design (capped size, no overlap with the\n  values row).\n- PumpScheduler: now always shows the water temperature next to power/\n  speed, and a small (optionally animated) impeller in the hero (new\n  \"animate\" setting). Added the shared graphics module (graphics.tsx)\n  with the impeller + thermometer + tempColor, used by both widgets;\n  moved spinDuration() into PumpWidgetBase.\n- Robustness (fixes the \"widget shows nothing\" report): the base widget\n  now reads each state''s current value FIRST and subscribes per state,\n  instead of one array subscribe. A pump whose newer schedule.* states\n  don''t exist yet (older backend) no longer blanks the whole widget —\n  telemetry, name and controls render regardless. (The schedule.* status\n  fields still need the v0.11.0+ backend, and the badge correctly shows\n  \"manual/off\" until scheduling is enabled for the pump.)\n\nHandbook DE+EN 9.4 note (small impeller); PDFs regenerated. README + news\n(11 languages).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6357e3189454314ff27eeca652289d0edf80ece","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/a6357e3189454314ff27eeca652289d0edf80ece"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/a20bb7b8b414664a69f1f585b186f22be2203c65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/a20bb7b8b414664a69f1f585b186f22be2203c65","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKGEyMGJiN2I4YjQxNDY2NGE2OWYxZjU4NWIxODZmMjJiZTIyMDNjNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/38e272181100c8333a0a2f7b28ea6f027053e7ac","sha":"38e272181100c8333a0a2f7b28ea6f027053e7ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/38e272181100c8333a0a2f7b28ea6f027053e7ac"}],"sha":"a20bb7b8b414664a69f1f585b186f22be2203c65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/a20bb7b8b414664a69f1f585b186f22be2203c65"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/38e272181100c8333a0a2f7b28ea6f027053e7ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:25:54Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:25:54Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"v0.11.0: PumpScheduler status widget + water temperature in PumpVisual\n\nNew \"Scheduler status\" vis-2 widget (PumpScheduler):\n- Shows what the built-in scheduler is doing per pump and why: current\n  output + target power, status badge (active/manual/fail-safe), reason\n  chips (curve/window/base + night protection/weather boost/frost hold),\n  active window, next change, sunrise/sunset, water temperature, live\n  power/rpm, and a control bar (on/off, quick power, SFC).\n- Fed by new read-only pumps.<n>.schedule.* status states the scheduler\n  publishes each tick (controlled/targetPower/sfc/source/raised/\n  nightProtection/hold/failSafe/window/nextChangeTs). Registered in\n  vite.config.ts + io-package.json; i18n for all 11 languages; preview SVG.\n\nPure core (schedule.ts, mirrored to src-admin): decideTarget now also\nreturns source/raised/nightProtected/hold for the status states and the\nwidget (covered by new unit tests, 123 passing).\n\nPumpVisual: when telemetry.waterTemperature has a value, the impeller\nshifts left and a filled, colour-coded thermometer with the reading\nappears on the right; unchanged without a value. Shared common helper\npumpDeviceName().\n\nDocs: handbook DE+EN chapter 9.4 (scheduler widget) + 9.2 thermometer\nnote; PDFs regenerated. README + news (11 languages).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e2ad3dcb82ef325b11eef7332955e7b6f61e3a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/9e2ad3dcb82ef325b11eef7332955e7b6f61e3a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/38e272181100c8333a0a2f7b28ea6f027053e7ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/38e272181100c8333a0a2f7b28ea6f027053e7ac","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKDM4ZTI3MjE4MTEwMGM4MzMzYTBhMmY3YjI4ZWE2ZjAyNzA1M2U3YWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/bbe8d7521c60b25707b43c61ee54df5a19c95a15","sha":"bbe8d7521c60b25707b43c61ee54df5a19c95a15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/bbe8d7521c60b25707b43c61ee54df5a19c95a15"}],"sha":"38e272181100c8333a0a2f7b28ea6f027053e7ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/38e272181100c8333a0a2f7b28ea6f027053e7ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/bbe8d7521c60b25707b43c61ee54df5a19c95a15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:27:22Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:27:22Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"v0.10.1: telemetry.waterTemperature reflects the effective curve source\n\nBugfix. Previously telemetry.waterTemperature was mirrored ONLY from the\npump''s on-device sensor (waterTempSensor = temperature/temperature2), so\nwhen the curve was driven by an EXTERNAL object (e.g. a Homematic water\nsensor picked via the object magnifier) the state stayed empty (null) —\neven though that external sensor correctly drove the power curve.\n\n- runScheduler now mirrors the effective curve source''s raw value into\n  telemetry.waterTemperature (external OIDs included), and logs a debug\n  line when the source has no finite value. The scheduler already\n  subscribes to curve.source (collectSourceOids), so the state stays\n  fresh on every source change.\n- The poll loop''s on-device-sensor mirror is now the FALLBACK only —\n  it runs when no enabled curve source is configured, so the two writers\n  never conflict.\n- objects.ts: updated the waterTemperature doc comment; unit stays \"°C\"\n  (confirmed correct in source and esbuild output \"\\xB0C\"; the \"Â°C\" seen\n  in a running object is an admin round-trip re-encoding, not adapter code\n  — it self-corrects on the next adapter start via extendObject).\n- Handbook DE+EN: note that waterTemperature reflects the effective curve\n  source (external sensor included); PDFs regenerated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6316b9756e93dbde5bd5b86a0856215b8d7610f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/a6316b9756e93dbde5bd5b86a0856215b8d7610f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/bbe8d7521c60b25707b43c61ee54df5a19c95a15","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/bbe8d7521c60b25707b43c61ee54df5a19c95a15","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKGJiZThkNzUyMWM2MGIyNTcwN2I0M2M2MWVlNTRkZjVhMTljOTVhMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/1a195f3bf41470cd12a1080d87ebe05450776c43","sha":"1a195f3bf41470cd12a1080d87ebe05450776c43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/1a195f3bf41470cd12a1080d87ebe05450776c43"}],"sha":"bbe8d7521c60b25707b43c61ee54df5a19c95a15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/bbe8d7521c60b25707b43c61ee54df5a19c95a15"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/1a195f3bf41470cd12a1080d87ebe05450776c43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T06:53:57Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T06:53:57Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"v0.10.0: most detailed scheduler debug logging + updated forum thread\n\nLogging/Debugging (per the project''s verbindliches Logging standard):\n- decideTarget gained an optional `trace: string[]` output that records a\n  human-readable step at every decision branch (base from curve/window,\n  Q_min floor, night protection, each matching weather rule, actuator\n  windows, the Q_max ceiling, final power/SFC). Covered by new unit tests.\n  Mirrored to src-admin/src/schedule.ts.\n- runScheduler now logs, per tick and per pump at debug level: the raw\n  source values, the full input snapshot (raw/smoothed/mapped water temp\n  with tau & hysteresis, resolved sunrise/sunset, day/night, priority &\n  min/max power), the decision trace, the ramp/hold resolution, the\n  \"unchanged -> nothing sent\" cases and the next re-evaluation time.\n- setupAstro/recomputeAstro log the resolved location mode, system coords\n  and per-pump coordinates + sun times; onMessage logs the geocode query\n  and its result/failure. Secrets are never logged.\n\nDocs:\n- doc/forum-tester-thread.md rewritten for V0.10.0, covering everything\n  since V0.5.0 (max power per pump, astro windows, location + interactive\n  map, night protection, actuator windows, clearer scheduler settings,\n  detailed debugging).\n- Handbook (DE+EN): new \"reading the scheduler decision log\" section;\n  PDFs regenerated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"67beb228d5ab2e4cc0846eb3da0a310d48b762f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/67beb228d5ab2e4cc0846eb3da0a310d48b762f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/1a195f3bf41470cd12a1080d87ebe05450776c43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/1a195f3bf41470cd12a1080d87ebe05450776c43","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKDFhMTk1ZjNiZjQxNDcwY2QxMmExMDgwZDg3ZWJlMDU0NTA3NzZjNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/4f0ecc26ec8507c774adf47529e260b7bae7862b","sha":"4f0ecc26ec8507c774adf47529e260b7bae7862b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/4f0ecc26ec8507c774adf47529e260b7bae7862b"}],"sha":"1a195f3bf41470cd12a1080d87ebe05450776c43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/1a195f3bf41470cd12a1080d87ebe05450776c43"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/4f0ecc26ec8507c774adf47529e260b7bae7862b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T06:23:34Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T06:23:34Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"v0.9.1: graceful hint when the location map tiles are blocked\n\nLocationPicker now listens for Leaflet \"tileerror\" and overlays a clear\nmessage when the OSM tiles fail to load (typically the admin CSP blocking\nthe external tile host). The location stays fully settable via marker\nclick/drag, the coordinate fields and the address search. +1 i18n key\nx 11 languages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"66334ce69364433edd39adf47311955297155865","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/66334ce69364433edd39adf47311955297155865"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/4f0ecc26ec8507c774adf47529e260b7bae7862b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/4f0ecc26ec8507c774adf47529e260b7bae7862b","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKDRmMGVjYzI2ZWM4NTA3Yzc3NGFkZjQ3NTI5ZTI2MGI3YmFlNzg2MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/2ebe1b44966b9421b8e8615c47946a071908bd5f","sha":"2ebe1b44966b9421b8e8615c47946a071908bd5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/2ebe1b44966b9421b8e8615c47946a071908bd5f"}],"sha":"4f0ecc26ec8507c774adf47529e260b7bae7862b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/4f0ecc26ec8507c774adf47529e260b7bae7862b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/2ebe1b44966b9421b8e8615c47946a071908bd5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T15:25:46Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T15:25:46Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"v0.9.0: Phase 13 — actuator schedule windows\n\nA schedule window''s mode can now be \"actuator\": PumpSchedule gains\ntarget/onValue/offValue. decideTarget appends the actuator-window writes to\nits actuators list — for each distinct target, the on-value while any of\nits windows is active, else the off-value (omitted → left untouched);\npower/sfc windows are unaffected. Combined with the astro bounds this gives\ne.g. a waterfall on from 09:00 to sunset. windowTarget/decideTarget filter\nout actuator windows from the power/sfc decision; validatePlans requires an\nactuator target and lets actuator windows overlap. +3 core tests (119\ntotal). UI: an \"Actuator\" mode in the window row (target picker + on/off\nvalues, renderPlanValue extracted); +3 i18n keys x 11 languages. Handbook\n10.2 (DE+EN) + PDFs.\n\nThis completes the four astro building blocks (windows, night protection,\nPV-boost via raise-only rules, actuator windows).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"084c12ed6160fbdb58325ad984e04c2fb7e14b30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/084c12ed6160fbdb58325ad984e04c2fb7e14b30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/2ebe1b44966b9421b8e8615c47946a071908bd5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/2ebe1b44966b9421b8e8615c47946a071908bd5f","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKDJlYmUxYjQ0OTY2Yjk0MjFiOGU4NjE1YzQ3OTQ2YTA3MTkwOGJkNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/42980a93b48aadfbe769969efcc35fe407a8f11c","sha":"42980a93b48aadfbe769969efcc35fe407a8f11c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/42980a93b48aadfbe769969efcc35fe407a8f11c"}],"sha":"2ebe1b44966b9421b8e8615c47946a071908bd5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/2ebe1b44966b9421b8e8615c47946a071908bd5f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/42980a93b48aadfbe769969efcc35fe407a8f11c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T15:01:42Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T15:01:42Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"v0.8.0: Phase 13 — night protection (no reduction at night)\n\nNew per-pump nightProtection {enabled, minWaterTemp?, floorPower?}: during\nthe astronomical night, if the curve''s water temperature is at/above the\nthreshold (default 18 °C), decideTarget floors the power (default 100 %) —\napplied after the minPower floor and before the weather rules, still capped\nby maxPower. With no curve source it protects unconditionally; with no\nlocation (astro unavailable) it does nothing. Implements the research point\nthat the oxygen minimum is at night, so a warm-night reduction is harmful.\n\nCore: exported isAstroDay(); +5 tests (116 total). UI: a \"Night protection\"\nsection in the temperature/weather editor (+6 i18n keys x 11 languages).\nHandbook 10.4 (DE+EN) + PDFs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"458e4d5daf7ce89db919392cff30b72936ebc0fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/458e4d5daf7ce89db919392cff30b72936ebc0fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/42980a93b48aadfbe769969efcc35fe407a8f11c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"http