 (DE+EN, astro windows + location) with regenerated\nPDFs, admin bundle rebuilt at 0.7.0.\n\nFeature summary (built across the WIP commits on this branch):\n- Schedule window bounds can be a clock time or sunrise/sunset ± offset;\n  a night window wraps past midnight. Per-pump astro states, recomputed\n  daily; the scheduler feeds each pump''s sun times to the decision core.\n- Location: ioBroker system / one shared / per pump, via an interactive\n  Leaflet/OSM map, address search (backend geocoding) or coordinates.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c25a4880a31449bcff7eeab0a847b9e8caf3d076","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/c25a4880a31449bcff7eeab0a847b9e8caf3d076"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/cbfd378b7bda714f3bbcb12e6b12598d7e9e561c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/cbfd378b7bda714f3bbcb12e6b