s + address search. Uses an emoji divIcon (no\n  external marker-icon assets → avoids the MF/CSP issue); only the OSM tiles\n  are external. Geocoding runs in the backend via socket.sendTo(\"geocode\").\n- Scheduler: instance-level location section in the list view (mode\n  system/shared/individual; the map for \"shared\"), a per-pump location on\n  the pump tab for \"individual\"; reads/writes native locationMode/latitude/\n  longitude and per-pump schedules[dn].location. +18 i18n keys x 11 languages.\n- leaflet ^1.9.4 (+ @types) added to the admin bundle (bundled/shared).\n\nCompletes the v0.7.0 UI; handbook + version bump + release follow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"01d76a74ba869dc4c2ad19d1843f217c0d022321","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/01d76a74ba869dc4c2ad19d1843f217c0d022321"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/59286595ac93b36e5b36f8266edc76cc9025ded1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/use