e schedule table\n\nEach schedule window''s start and end can now be set to a clock time OR\nsunrise/sunset ± an offset in minutes (renderBoundCell: a mode select plus\na time or offset field). +4 i18n keys x 11 languages. With the default\n\"system\" location mode the backend uses the ioBroker system coordinates,\nso astro windows already resolve for installs that have those set.\n\nPart of the in-progress v0.7.0; the interactive map + location-mode UI follow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d5c3cd97d5c64aaf81ec19c0b57d45983177ff1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/9d5c3cd97d5c64aaf81ec19c0b57d45983177ff1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/ef3bb2fa6335cbe725300f14d054a7df859803c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/ef3bb2fa6335cbe725300f14d054a7df859803c5","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKGVmM2JiMmZhNjM