, astroForDate → {sunriseMin,sunsetMin}. +14 tests.\n- suncalc dependency; io-package native locationMode/latitude/longitude;\n  common.messagebox:true for the geocode message handler.\n- objects.ts: per-pump astro channel + states (sunrise/sunset/sunriseTs/\n  sunsetTs/isDay); allowed-roles test updated (date.sunrise/sunset,\n  value.time, indicator).\n- main.ts: setupAstro() reads system.config coords, recomputeAstro() writes\n  each pump''s sunrise/sunset, a midnight timer recomputes daily; runScheduler\n  feeds the per-pump AstroTimes to decideTarget/minutesUntilNextChange and\n  writes astro.isDay; onMessage ''geocode'' resolves an address via Nominatim\n  from the backend (no browser CORS/CSP); midnight timer cleared in onUnload.\n- PumpScheduleConfig.location for per-pump coords in \"individual\" mode.\n\nPart of the in-progress v0.7.0; the admin UI (map + astro window editor) follows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"68617e1eb97ef15bf8318058d0735e59faa294f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/68617e1eb97ef15bf8318058d0735e59faa294f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/70aed26f03ebfda62b02c0abeca8eb2b71ba49bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"http