thor":{"date":"2026-09-09T13:42:24Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T13:42:24Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"Phase 13 WIP (core): astro window bounds (sunrise/sunset ± offset)\n\nExtend the scheduling core so a window boundary can be a fixed clock time\nOR an astronomical event: PumpSchedule gains startMode/startOffset and\nendMode/endOffset (WindowBoundMode \"clock\"|\"sunrise\"|\"sunset\"). New\nAstroTimes {sunriseMin,sunsetMin}, resolveBound(), and a midnight-wrapping\nactiveWindow() so a \"sunset → sunrise\" night window works. decideTarget/\nwindowTarget/minutesUntilNextChange take an optional astro argument\n(default NO_ASTRO → astro bounds skipped, fully backward compatible).\nvalidatePlans skips the static order/overlap checks for astro windows\n(they resolve daily and may wrap). +5 unit tests (103 total).\n\nPart of the in-progress v0.7.0 (astro/location); backend + UI follow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45cfead37c8c079c86021b2bcce631652d3efdf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/45cfead37c8c079c86021b2bcce631652d3efdf9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/9be31367c6b5a0c8d01965b86039f34ea670e704","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/9be31367c6b5a0c8d01965b86039f34ea670e704","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKDliZTMxMzY3YzZiNWEwYzhkMDE5NjViODYwMzlmMzRlYTY3MGU3MDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/8daf7d920fd70ed68416621e26c55df86df0e4c7","sha":"8daf7d920fd70ed68416621e26c55df86df0e4c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/8daf7d920fd70ed68416621e26c55df86df0e4c7"}],"sha":"9be31367c6b5a0c8d01965b86039f34ea670e704","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/9be31367c6b5a0c8d01965b86039f34ea670e704"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/8daf7d920fd70ed68416621e26c55df86df0e4c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T13:27:40Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T13:27:40Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"docs(research): add chapter 7 (day/night) from the extended study\n\nTranscribe the day/night findings of the extended research (now ~160\nqueries / ~290 pages): the O2 minimum sits before sunrise / ~2 h after\nthe last feeding, fish are nocturnal/crepuscular, digestion (not the base\nmetabolism) is the real time-of-day factor, and a summer night-time\nreduction of the FILTER FLOW contradicts the literature. Astro is useful\nas a protection window (no reduction) and for side actuators\n(waterfall/UVC time windows), and in winter for a PV-following modulation\nbetween Q_min and Q_min+15 %. Design basis for the upcoming Phase-13\nastro/location feature.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b4f60641f05685e2b310db4e9619d76de0c2c3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/9b4f60641f05685e2b310db4e9619d76de0c2c3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/8daf7d920fd70ed68416621e26c55df86df0e4c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/8daf7d920fd70ed68416621e26c55df86df0e4c7","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKDhkYWY3ZDkyMGZkNzBlZDY4NDE2NjIxZTI2YzU1ZGY4NmRmMGU0Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/ba26a53f4580b64ae33042f3814ba4eaf277bc50","sha":"ba26a53f4580b64ae33042f3814ba4eaf277bc50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/ba26a53f4580b64ae33042f3814ba4eaf277bc50"}],"sha":"8daf7d920fd70ed68416621e26c55df86df0e4c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/8daf7d920fd70ed68416621e26c55df86df0e4c7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/ba26a53f4580b64ae33042f3814ba4eaf277bc50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T12:47:11Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T12:47:11Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"v0.6.0: maximum power % per pump (hard ceiling)\n\nNew PumpScheduleConfig.maxPower (0..100, default 100), applied LAST in\ndecideTarget so it caps everything — the temperature curve, weather-rule\nraises/boostMax and the missing-source fail-safe. For pumps that only run\nup to e.g. 90 %. UI: a \"Maximum power %\" field in the scheduler fine-tuning\n(label + placeholder + help). +2 unit tests, +2 i18n keys x 11 languages,\nhandbook 11.3 (DE+EN) + PDFs.\n\nAstro/day-night power reduction (next feature) intentionally deferred until\nthe user''s scientific research on the topic is available.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0573184111808a4583f73f576baa894d17e5a476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/0573184111808a4583f73f576baa894d17e5a476"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/ba26a53f4580b64ae33042f3814ba4eaf277bc50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos",