ail":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T12:17:19Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"fix(scheduler): subscribe to sources before first evaluation (v0.5.1)\n\nOn startup maybeStartScheduler() fired subscribeScheduleSources() and\nrunScheduler() both as fire-and-forget, so the first runScheduler read an\nempty scheduleSourceOids set — the curve source looked \"missing\" and the\ncurve hit the fail-safe (100 %) even though the water sensor had a value\n(seen live: hm-rpc water temperature available, yet fail-safe warned).\nNow the start awaits the subscription (which fills scheduleSourceOids)\nbefore evaluating. Folded into the still-untagged 0.5.1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff19978a120fd89b72773ba769a01814964a7ddb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/ff19978a120fd89b72773ba769a01814964a7ddb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/679660ca77a792f9309f763b7dc7f9f554a39295","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://a