itzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"v0.5.1: fix water-temperature sensor dropdown rendering\n\nThe new \"Water temperature sensor\" picker rendered as an empty, flat field\n(empty value, label overlapping, no visible dropdown). Rebuilt from a\n`TextField select` into an explicit FormControl + InputLabel(shrink) +\nSelect(displayEmpty, notched) + FormHelperText — same robust structure as\nthe priority select — so the field, the \"none\" default and the dropdown\narrow show correctly. No functional/back-end changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"88e29974263fe61e169fd8747ff7130cd9078f12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/88e29974263fe61e169fd8747ff7130cd9078f12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/895803d23ccdab236c6f65214c3595f8d24268a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/895803d23ccdab236c