/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/b8a8838f174c78de38341a511ed5cfce54b84251/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T11:40:48Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T11:40:48Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"Phase 12 (v0.5.0): water-temperature sensor picker + clearer scheduler UI\n\n- New per-pump \"Water temperature sensor\" dropdown listing the pump''s own\n  device temperature sensors WITH their live value, so the user picks which\n  one reads the water. The choice feeds a new read-only state\n  telemetry.waterTemperature and pre-fills the curve source (external\n  sensors stay selectable via the object picker).\n- objects.ts: new telemetry.waterTemperature state (value.temperature).\n- main.ts: mirrors the picked device sensor into telemetry.waterTemperature\n  each poll; schedule.ts: PumpScheduleConfig.waterTempSensor (UI/backend\n  metadata, decideTarget ignores it).\n- Usability: every scheduler field now has a full label, a suggested value\n  (placeholder) and a help text — minimum power (Q_min), temperature\n  smoothing, hysteresis (°C), max change per hour, the curve-vs-windows\n  priority and the curve source. +17 i18n keys x 11 languages.\n- Handbook chapter 11 (DE+EN) updated; PDFs regenerated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a98ba929b154fc5ee555f719bcbd1f3179fced25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/a98ba929b154fc5ee555f719bcbd1f3179fced25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/b8a8838f174c78de38341a511ed5cfce54b84251","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/b8a8838f174c78de38341a511ed5cfce54b84251","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKGI4YTg4MzhmMTc0Yzc4ZGUzODM0MWE1MTFlZDVjZmNlNTRiODQyNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/9aaf53db6774ddba40bb2e54738fd062962af916","sha":"9aaf53db6774ddba40bb2e54738fd062962af916","url":"https://