12/13.\n  PDFs regenerated.\n- CI: ioBroker/testing-action-check @v1 -> @v2 (repochecker W3028; the\n  testing-action-adapter/deploy pins are left at @v1 as before).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55e02909fa03f40d7b04fe5d62a098543a787a30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/55e02909fa03f40d7b04fe5d62a098543a787a30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/9aaf53db6774ddba40bb2e54738fd062962af916","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/9aaf53db6774ddba40bb2e54738fd062962af916","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKDlhYWY1M2RiNjc3NGRkYmE0MGJiMmU1NDczOGZkMDYyOTYyYWY5MTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/637b0a566e0a98be7646ae195e185369221fbfeb","sha":"637b0a566e0a98be7646ae195e185369221fbfeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/637b0a566e0a98be7646ae195e185369221fbfeb"}],"sha":"9aaf53db6774ddba40bb2e54738fd062962af916","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/9aaf53db6774ddba40bb2e54738fd062962af916"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/637b0a566e0a98be7646ae195e185369221fbfeb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T10:06:53Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T10:06:53Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"Phase 12 (v0.4.0): water-temperature control model\n\nRework the temperature/weather scheduler around the pond-flow research\n(doc/research/teichpumpe-durchfluss-temperatur-wetter.md).\n\nCore (schedule.ts, mirrored to src-admin):\n- decideTarget() replaces targetForConfig/evaluateConditions, returning a\n  full ScheduleDecision {sfc, power|\"hold\", actuators[], failSafe}.\n- Weather rules only ever RAISE the flow: new effect set raisePower /\n  boostMax / hold / sfc / setState (generic actuator). The water curve\n  sets the base flow; DEFAULT_CURVE_POINTS (Q10-2 @17 C) as a preset.\n- New per-pump limits: minPower (Q_min), smoothingHours (EMA), hysteresisK,\n  rampPercentPerHour; rampTowards()/updateEma() helpers. Missing sensor ->\n  fail-safe 100 %. collectSourceOids() excludes setState targets (outputs).\n\nBackend (main.ts):\n- Per-pump PumpScheduleRuntime (EMA/hysteresis/ramp/hold). smoothedSources\n  conditions the curve source; runScheduler resolves hold/ramp, writes\n  actuators on change (setForeignStateAsync), warns on sensor loss and on a\n  native-SFC conflict (status.fcStatus + isSfcActive).\n\nAdmin UI (PondpumpScheduler.tsx):\n- New effect dropdown, Q_min/smoothing/hysteresis/ramp fields, \"Load default\n  curve\", a real object picker (SelectID from @iobroker/gui-components), and\n  no pump-telemetry default for the source. +22 i18n keys x 11 languages.\n\nNote: telemetry.temperature is the pump''s DEVICE temperature, not the water;\nthe curve/rule source default is removed so users pick a real water sensor.\nBreaking: weather rules from 0.3.0 (Power %/SFC/Off) become inert -> reconfigure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"83aadc0a06b841ee5bea2862dcd5a87ee3416acd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/83aadc0a06b841ee5bea2862dcd5a87ee3416acd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/637b0a566e0a98be7646ae195e185369221fbfeb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/637b0a566e0a98be7646ae195e185369221fbfeb","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKDYzN2IwYTU2NmUwYTk4YmU3NjQ2YWUxOTVlMTg1MzY5MjIxZmJmZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/e5ecdf90e1409d48056dc72648937794163426f0","sha":"e5ecdf90e1409d48056dc72648937794163426f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/e5ecdf90e1409d48056dc72648937794163426f0"}],"sha":"637b0a566e0a98be7646ae195e185369221fbfeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/637b0a566e0a98be7646ae195e185369221fbfeb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/e5ecdf90e1409d48056dc72648937794163426f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T08:31:36Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T08:31:36Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"docs: add pond-pump flow vs. temperature/weather research (PDF + markdown)\n\nDesign basis for the temperature/weather scheduler parameters (Phase 11/12):\nwater temperature is the primary control variable (Q10-2 demand curve, T_ref\n17 °C, clamp to Q_min); weather modifiers only raise the flow / drive aeration/\nwaterfall; 24 h mean + hysteresis + ramp; sensor failure -> 100 %.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5568222ee2b51ef57faa855c201af9120a5f21af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/5568222ee2b51ef57faa855c201af9120a5f21af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/e5ecdf90e1409d48056dc72648937794163426f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/e5ecdf90e1409d48056dc72648937794163426f0","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKGU1ZWNkZjkwZTE0MDlkNDgwNTZkYzcyNjQ4OTM3Nzk0MTYzNDI2ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/e6a2e811098aa4f2a3416b1ed563c21c54c6179f","sha":"e6a2e811098aa4f2a3416b1ed563c21c54c6179f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/e6a2e811098aa4f2a3416b1ed563c21c54c6179f"}],"sha":"e5ecdf90e1409d48056dc72648937794163426f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/e5ecdf90e1409d48056dc72648937794163426f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/e6a2e811098aa4f2a3416b1ed563c21c54c6179f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T07:37:00Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T07:37:00Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"Phase 11 (admin UI): temperature/weather conditions editor + 0.3.0\n\nExtend the per-pump scheduler tab with a \"Conditions\" section:\n- a priority select (conditions override the active window, or apply only\n  outside the windows),\n- a temperature→power curve (enable toggle, source state id defaulting to the\n  pump''s telemetry.temperature, an add/remove points table),\n- a threshold-rules table (source OID, comparison, threshold, effect\n  power%/SFC/Off, value) with the pump temperature prefilled for new rules.\n- 16 new i18n keys across all 11 languages; admin bundle rebuilt.\n\nBump to 0.3.0 + news. Needs live testing in a real admin >=8.0.11 before release.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7509c259b0451f2bfdad1fad855cacf800072157","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/7509c259b0451f2bfdad1fad855cacf800072157"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/e6a2e811098aa4f2a3416b1ed563c21c54c6179f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/e6a2e811098aa4f2a3416b1ed563c21c54c6179f","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKGU2YTJlODExMDk4YWE0ZjJhMzQxNmIxZWQ1NjNjMjFjNTRjNjE3OWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/71343c8d2bafd826589d4401be1695a0fb2c8089","sha":"71343c8d2bafd826589d4401be1695a0fb2c8089","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/71343c8d2bafd826589d4401be1695a0fb2c8089"}],"sha":"e6a2e811098aa4f2a3416b1ed563c21c54c6179f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/e6a2e811098aa4f2a3416b1ed563c21c54c6179f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/71343c8d2bafd826589d4401be1695a0fb2c8089/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T07:30:02Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T07:30:02Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"Phase 11 (core + backend): temperature/weather scheduler conditions\n\nExtend the scheduler with per-pump temperature/weather conditions:\n- schedule.ts: new types (ConditionRule, TempCurve, CurvePoint, Comparison,\n  ConditionPriority) on PumpScheduleConfig (curve, rules, conditionPriority).\n  compareValue, interpolateCurve (clamped, linear), evaluateConditions (first\n  matching rule wins, else the enabled curve), collectSourceOids, and\n  targetForConfig(config, nowMin, sources) combining windows + conditions per\n  the priority (\"override\" | \"outsideOnly\"). +14 unit tests (95 total).\n- main.ts: subscribe to the condition source OIDs (own telemetry.temperature\n  and external weather OIDs), read their current values each tick, feed them to\n  targetForConfig, and re-evaluate (debounced) on a source change — source\n  states arrive ack:true, handled before onStateChange''s command path. Timers\n  cleared in onUnload.\n\nUI (curve + rules editors) follows in the next commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"90341b454a7aa2db1150679d8aec7eb444eca946","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/90341b454a7aa2db1150679d8aec7eb444eca946"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/71343c8d2bafd826589d4401be1695a0fb2c8089","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcj