-05T08:11:36Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T08:11:36Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"admin-8 GUI API generation 2: declare guiApi:2 + serve mf-manifest.json\n\nadmin >=8 gates custom components by \"GUI API generation\": generation 2 =\n@iobroker/gui-components (React 19 / MUI 9), generation 1 = the legacy\nadapter-react-v5 (React 18 / MUI 6). Our migrated component was rejected as\ngeneration 1 for two reasons, both fixed here:\n\n- tasks.js now copies build/mf-manifest.json next to customComponents.js.\n  The gate fetches <dir>/mf-manifest.json to read the shared library; it was\n  never served (404) so detection fell back to generation 1. The manifest\n  names @iobroker/gui-components → generation 2.\n- jsonConfig custom fields now declare \"guiApi\": 2 (authoritative) and drop\n  the deprecated \"bundlerType\" (ignored since generation 2).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"538ad5e391649630050d5318d35424b0e45125a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/538ad5e391649630050d5318d35424b0e45125a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/05c9cfe7607f4aabb45175bbe7fd25db69391380","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.githu