); raise minimums\n\niobroker.admin >=8.0.0 runs on React 19 + MUI 9. Adapt the admin custom\ncomponent accordingly and raise the declared minimums.\n\n- io-package: globalDependency admin >=7.6.20 -> >=8.0.0; add node >=22 to\n  common.dependencies (js-controller >=6.0.11 unchanged). version 0.2.0 + news.\n- src-admin: swap @iobroker/adapter-react-v5 -> @iobroker/gui-components ^10\n  (I18n + modulefederation.admin.config; adapter-react-v5 has no React 19\n  release), @iobroker/json-config ^8 -> ^9, react/react-dom ^18 -> ^19,\n  @mui/material + @mui/icons-material ^6 -> ^9, @types/react(-dom) ^19.\n  tsc/eslint clean against the new stack (dropped a now-unnecessary\n  ScheduleMode assertion). Rebuilt admin/custom bundle.\n- vis-2 widgets untouched: the vis-2 host is still React 18 / MUI 6.\n- dependabot: document the two-host major split (admin 19/9, widgets 18/6).\n\nBackend build/lint/tests unchanged (81+57 green). Needs live testing in a\nreal admin >=8.0.0 before release.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"52b91f29b797c988a890e9b3fc9c176ef45e8e29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/52b91f29b797c988a890e9b3fc9c176ef45e8e29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/e28dfcc0a70ff1ec7136dd82146da9722cbb2d88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","receiv