  noTranslation:true. This is valid against the official jsonConfig schema\n  (label = string) and exempts the pattern from the i18n key scan — clears\n  the repochecker schema (5512) and i18n (5612) findings the func-object form\n  and bare-string form respectively produced.\n- doc/handbook (de+en): add chapter 10 \"Schedules\" (enable a pump, define\n  non-overlapping windows setting power %/SFC, base power, how it runs);\n  renumber Troubleshooting/Privacy to 11/12; regenerate both PDFs.\n- README: refine the 0.0.9 changelog to describe the Connection-tab Schedules\n  section and the per-pump \"Scheduler – <pump>\" tabs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ee8160fc68a282a031551ea4db27723cceccac2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/7ee8160fc68a282a031551ea4db27723cceccac2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/6f61fde52cb2ca34c1e6d15ed5de6f4fd2fbf19b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_v