://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/a6c7508687158f929b73bf9d86ed954aa725a1b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T13:24:28Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T13:24:28Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"Phase 9: complete i18n (9 langs) + Dependabot /src-admin entry\n\n- admin/i18n: add the 17 scheduler keys to es/fr/it/nl/pl/pt/ru/uk/zh-cn\n  (all 11 languages now consistent — clears repochecker E5604)\n- dependabot.yml: add /src-admin to the npm directories and pin the\n  admin-only singleton majors (@mui/icons-material, @iobroker/json-config)\n  by major, matching the React 18 / MUI 6 host constraint (clears W8905)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"60ca3e03358b4571acbf4482a552cb8d4cbf948e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/60ca3e03358b4571acbf4482a552cb8d4cbf948e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/a6c7508687158f929b73bf9d86ed954aa725a1b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/a6c7508687158f929b73bf9d86ed954aa725a1b8","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKGE2Yzc1MDg2ODcxNThmOTI5YjczYmY5ZDg2ZWQ5NTRhYTcyNWExYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/a89eb57f2caff7758f9cc58f005a69aa8e74cc5a","sha":"a89eb57f2caff7758f9cc58f005a69aa8e74cc5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/a89eb57f2caff7758f9cc58f005a69aa8e74cc5a"}],"sha":"a6c7508687158f929b73bf9d86ed954aa725a1b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/a6c7508687158f929b73bf9d86ed954aa725a1b8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/a89eb57f2caff7758f9cc58f005a69aa8e74cc5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T13:20:06Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T13:20:06Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"Phase 9: per-pump time schedules\n\nAdapter settings gain a scheduler (custom jsonConfig component built from\nsrc-admin/ via module federation): the detected pumps are listed with an\nenable switch; enabling a pump gives it its own tab with a base power\n(applied outside all windows) and a sorted, live-validated list of time\nwindows that each set a power % or switch SFC on/off.\n\n- src/lib/schedule.ts: pure, tested scheduler core (parse/validate/target/\n  next-change); 15 unit tests. Frontend copy in src-admin/src/schedule.ts.\n- main.ts: loads native.schedules, starts a chained-setTimeout scheduler\n  after the first poll, applies control.speed / control.sfc at window\n  boundaries (skips unchanged targets), re-validates before applying.\n- src-admin/: Vite + @module-federation/vite React component\n  (ConfigCustomPondpumpSet/Components/PondpumpScheduler) extending\n  ConfigGeneric; built to admin/custom/ via `node tasks --admin`.\n- io-package.json: native.schedules default; version 0.0.9 + 11-lang news.\n- Overlapping windows are rejected in both the editor and the backend.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"09ec6ad4666c93ca68ee91c057f272d16508fb16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/09ec6ad4666c93ca68ee91c057f272d16508fb16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/a89eb57f2caff7758f9cc58f005a69aa8e74cc5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/a89eb57f2caff7758f9cc58f005a69aa8e74cc5a","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKGE4OWViNTdmMmNhZmY3NzU4ZjljYzU4ZjAwNWE2OWFhOGU3NGNjNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/9db5db8247dd8980ab4fc0c2e2168e1de5a54f82","sha":"9db5db8247dd8980ab4fc0c2e2168e1de5a54f82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/9db5db8247dd8980ab4fc0c2e2168e1de5a54f82"}],"sha":"a89eb57f2caff7758f9cc58f005a69aa8e74cc5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/a89eb57f2caff7758f9cc58f005a69aa8e74cc5a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssb