","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"release: v0.0.7 (SFC real-speed widgets + processed dependency updates)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e7b19ee79677b91eca9c4749a1bd4358f47a60e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/9e7b19ee79677b91eca9c4749a1bd4358f47a60e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/1ea704eb9d84af00cb5ab7236c287295a00f6014","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/1ea704eb9d84af00cb5ab7236c287295a00f6014","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKDFlYTcwNGViOWQ4NGFmMDBjYjVhYjcyMzZjMjg3Mjk1YTAwZjYwMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/a2a3f5cd8d362c933cfa8666ce6f38f4633cdf83","sha":"a2a3f5cd8d362c933cfa8666ce6f38f4633cdf83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/a2a3f5cd8d362c933cfa8666ce6f38f4633cdf83"}],"sha":"1ea704eb9d84af00cb5ab7236c287295a00f6014","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/1ea704eb9d84af00cb5ab7236c287295a00f6014"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/a2a3f5cd8d362c933cfa8666ce6f38f4633cdf83/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T13:54:50Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T13:54:50Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"Widgets: reflect the real pump speed during SFC\n\nDuring SFC the device overrides the flow (e.g. 25% setpoint -> 100% actual)\nwhile control.speed (the setpoint) stays put, so the animation and readouts\nwere showing the stale setpoint.\n\n- New shared PumpWidgetBase.actualSpeedPct(): derives the real output % from the\n  live motor speed via an rpm-per-percent calibration learned while SFC is off\n  (falls back to the setpoint until calibrated); shared sfcActive() too.\n- PumpVisual: impeller AND ice crystal now spin by the actual speed (crystal is\n  speed-based like the impeller, not a fixed rate); the ''Power'' value shows the\n  real output during SFC.\n- PumpControl: subscribes to telemetry.speed; during SFC the Power slider shows\n  the actual output (disabled, since SFC controls the flow), quick buttons too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08fc79f56fdf9318f0ecc0feb88d1ace98b1fc2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/08fc79f56fdf9318f0ecc0feb88d1ace98b1fc2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/a2a3f5cd8d362c933cfa8666ce6f38f4633cdf83","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/a2a3f5cd8d362c933cfa8666ce6f38f4633cdf83","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKGEyYTNmNWNkOGQzNjJjOTMzY2ZhODY2NmNlNmYzOGY0NjMzY2RmODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/85d4308ea24d693089646db2b5d28ab0caee5255","sha":"85d4308ea24d693089646db2b5d28