vis-2 never uses; widget output rebuilt)\n- CI: actions/checkout v4 -> v5, actions/setup-node v4 -> v5 (handbook PDF workflow)\n\nDeclined with evidence (added dependabot ignore rules for the majors):\n- react/react-dom 19, @mui/material 9, vite 8, @vitejs/plugin-react 6 — the vis-2 host\n  shares React 18 + MUI 6 as module-federation singletons, and the latest\n  @iobroker/adapter-react-v5 (8.3.2) + flagship ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-material both\n  still target React 18 / MUI 6 / Vite 7 / plugin-react 5. Bumping breaks the host share.\n- typescript 7 — not yet supported by @iobroker/eslint-config.\n- ioBroker/testing-action-check kept at @v1 (the flagship material adapter''s version).\n\nVersion stays 0.0.6 pending a vis-2 test of the rebuilt (1.19.1) widget bundle.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5a01cc853977a18fabbde81f729c504729c6709","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/c5a01cc853977a18fabbde81f729c504729c6709"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/85d4308ea24d693089646db2b5d28ab0caee5255","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/r