login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/8fa99e6b327dd7c4a3123dfcbe03703b8f218967/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T09:11:53Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T09:11:53Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"SFC activation: reverse-engineered 0x5000 command, wired end-to-end\n\n- onet.ts: buildSetSfc (packet type 0x5000, payload [deviceIndex u32, flag, 0]);\n  reproduced byte-for-byte from captured app commands (new unit test).\n- objects.ts: new writable control.sfc (role switch); isSfcActive() reflects\n  the device fcStatus (SfcOn/SfcOff) back into control.sfc.\n- main.ts: handleCommand handles control.sfc -> buildSetSfc(ctrl.index, on).\n- PumpControl widget: SFC button is now live (SFC_ACTIVATION_SUPPORTED=true).\n- README 0.0.5: document SFC control (Seasonal Flow Control, not frost).\n- Handbook (de+en): clearer mitmproxy start command ''mitmweb --listen-port 8080''\n  with explicit proxy(8080)/UI(8081) port explanation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f95c078e2629f22486eef2eba3f9018bf62f9479","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/f95c078e2629f22486eef2eba3f9018bf62f9479"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/8fa99e6b327dd7c4a3123dfcbe03703b8f218967","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature"