s://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/78b1ad8dcf4897733df78dd18650205620ead7b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T08:45:09Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T08:45:09Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"Widgets: fix SFC detection + clearer speed animation\n\n- SFC is Seasonal Flow Control (not frost protection): fcStatus ''SfcOff''\n  now correctly reads as inactive (was showing the ice crystal while off).\n  Dropped the unreliable fcMode>0 heuristic; rely on fcStatus.\n- Relabel SFC in all 11 languages: ''Seasonal Flow Control (SFC)'' /\n  ''Saisonale Durchflussregelung'', temperature-dependent seasonal flow.\n- PumpVisual impeller: exponential speed->duration mapping so each 10%\n  step is clearly distinguishable (10% ~3.7s slow crawl ... 100% 0.25s).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"42e636ebd6b62ba52dd85b2a784f113cef0cabed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/42e636ebd6b62ba52dd85b2a784f113cef0cabed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/78b1ad8dcf4897733df78dd18650205620ead7b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_u