ers/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/481be8233ef7191868f779ee34ce0b5bbb620f0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T08:19:34Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T08:19:34Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"Phase 6: bundle vis-2 widgets + adapter-checker compliance\n\nvis-2 widgets bundled in the daemon adapter via common.visWidgets + a\ncommitted widgets/ build (Vite module-federation sources in src-widgets/,\nbuilt by tasks.js):\n- PumpVisual: impeller spins with pump speed (10% steps), rotating ice\n  crystal in frost-protection (SFC) mode, red cross when off; live power,\n  speed and setpoint.\n- PumpControl: on/off, speed slider + quick presets. SFC activation is\n  wired but gated until the device command is reverse-engineered (Phase 8).\n- Both widgets have instance + pump selectors and derive their OIDs\n  themselves. restartAdapters: [vis-2] reloads the widget set on install.\n\nCompliance / hardening (ioBroker adapter-checker):\n- Transport clients use adapter-managed timers (auto-cancelled on unload,\n  compact-mode safe) instead of bare setTimeout/setInterval.\n- connectionType local, admin globalDep >=7.6.17, noGit, removed prepare\n  lifecycle script, deploy on Node 24, adapter-tests needs check-and-lint,\n  dependabot cooldown/limits + auto-merge action migration, jsonConfig\n  connectionMode help translated in all 11 admin i18n files.\n\nBump to 0.0.5 (news in 11 languages, README changelog).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f25722b112abe1234ff3d37a51a33ef614e83eee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/f25722b112abe1234ff3d37a51a33ef614e83eee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/481be8233ef7191868f779ee34ce0b5bbb620f0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/481be8233ef7191868f779ee34ce0b5bbb620f0b","node_id":"C_kwDOTgUSpdoAKDQ4MWJlODIzM2VmNzE5MTg2OGY3NzllZTM0Y2UwYjViYmI2MjBmMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commit/909d5df448caacded9c6e605ecf5214eb482e6fc","sha":"909d5df448caacded9c6e605ecf5214eb482e6fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/909d5df448caacded9c6e605ecf5214eb482e6fc"}],"sha":"481be8233ef7191868f779ee34ce0b5bbb620f0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/481be8233ef7191868f779ee34ce0b5bbb620f0b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/follo