b.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/commits/8e5895be5fb522de53d1804c3abc335e56fe308b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T06:35:13Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T06:35:13Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"Phase 7: cloud XOR local — remove ''both'', clean object rebuild on switch, data-source state\n\n- connectionMode is now cloud or local only; the ''both'' option is removed from the\n  admin config and the type. A saved ''both'' is migrated to ''cloud'' with a warning\n- new info.connectionType state exposes the active data source (cloud/local)\n- when the mode changes between runs, the gateway + pumps object tree is deleted and\n  rebuilt cleanly so cloud and local objects never mix\n- docs: README config table, 10 translated READMEs and both handbooks updated (no ''both''),\n  handbook PDFs regenerated; WIP changelog entry added\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a942aa67412fa49e56f16216d98baf5f4af5436","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/trees/3a942aa67412fa49e56f16216d98baf5f4af5436"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.pondpump/git/commits/8e5895be5fb522de53d1804c3abc335e56fe308b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{