dated IAM policy document to include permissions for listing and reading release artifacts from the specified S3 bucket.\n- Modified production and staging configurations to pass the `artifact_bucket_arn` from remote state outputs.","tree":{"sha":"3f0972ac9a523f455dca1685ac83bf15db09c5c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Iamreyansh/MED0003_MFE/git/trees/3f0972ac9a523f455dca1685ac83bf15db09c5c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Iamreyansh/MED0003_MFE/git/commits/b77b564f1aecf960ae49caefa2172c64e06038ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64313600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sanskari27","id":64313600,"login":"sanskari27","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzEzNjAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Iamreyansh/MED0003_MFE/commit/b77b564f1aecf960ae49caefa2172c64e06038ec","node_id":"C_kwDOTghPVtoAKGI3N2I1NjRmMWFlY2Y5NjBhZTQ5Y2FlZmEyMTcyYzY0ZTA2MDM4ZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Iamreyansh/MED0003_MFE/commit/e67034891ac3d79f926e038473df74264b940f1f","sha":"e67034891ac3d79f926e038473df74264b940f1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Iamreyansh/MED0003_MFE/commits/e67034891ac3d79f926e038473df74264b940f1f"}],"sha":"b77b564f1aecf960ae49caefa2172c64e06038ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Iamreyansh/MED0003_MFE/commits/b77b564f1aecf960ae49caefa2172c64e06038ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64313600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sanskari27","id":64313600,"login":"sanskari27","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzEzNjAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanskari27","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Iamreyansh/MED0003_MFE/commits/e67034891ac3d79f926e038473df74264b940f1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T18:57:08Z","email":"64313600+sanskari27@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sanskar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T18:57:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: bootstrap shared Terraform apply and OIDC trust (#37)\n\n* fix: unblock shared apply and Terraform validate\n\nGrant SNS on the live apply role, forget monolith Route53 without instance\nkeys, and skip Checkov rules that do not match static MFE distributions.\n\n* fix: trust GitHub OIDC from feature-branch Terraform runs\n\nThe plan role only allowed main and pull_request, so workflow_dispatch on\nfix/terraform-ci could not assume the role.\n\n* fix: satisfy ShellCheck on promote target domain\n\nAssign TARGET_domain from cmd_targets into a local so SC2154 does not\nfail the scripts job.\n\n* fix: let Terraform PR validate plan staging and comment\n\nDrop the terraform environment from validate so GITHUB_TOKEN can comment\non the PR, and grant the plan role SSM Describe plus Budgets tag reads.","tree":{"sha":"157e90bbeaaebaa40291fef3190952852c8648c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Iamreyansh/MED0003_MFE/git/trees/157e90bbeaaebaa40291fef3190952852c8648c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Iamreyansh/MED0003_MFE/git/commits/e67034891ac3d79f926e038473df74264b940f1f","verification":{"payload":"tree 157e90bbeaaebaa40291fef3190952852c8648c0\nparent f52412c327470213dcafadd26441b0fd08844e5f\nauthor Sanskar <64313600+sanskari27@users.noreply.github.com> 1787770628 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787770628 +0530\n\nfix: bootstrap shared Terraform apply and OIDC trust (#37)\n\n* fix: unblock shared apply and Terraform validate\n\nGrant SNS on the live apply role, forget monolith Route53 without instance\nkeys, and skip Checkov rules that do not match static MFE distributions.\n\n* fix: trust GitHub OIDC from feature-branch Terraform runs\n\nThe plan role only allowed main and pull_request, so workflow_dispatch on\nfix/terraform-ci could not assume the role.\n\n* fix: satisfy ShellCheck on promote target domain\n\nAssign TARGET_domain from cmd_targets into a local so SC2154 does not\nfail the scripts job.\n\n* fix: let Terraform PR validate plan staging and comment\n\nDrop the terraform environment from validate so GITHUB_TOKEN can comment\non the PR, and grant the plan role SSM Describe plus Budgets tag reads.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjzcECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADq4QADBxfRZxPW6/kvtGCO2uMUFQ\nXmZvqA8ZZ8DcDi2oqMM1YtjVvfoEl5yFedQLcJGocbdLq1Ziv5azpOAonic70RkL\n8iGdomuewgwKPE96BDDxkUDW5//RYzm5fYUGmhFDW9Kr1qHqeAj2i27giUNr7inE\nQ2SR1yW+Y2e66mLzEkq/9GLiqDvn