cape/network-analyzer-cw/commit/904457173d12f1c8854c74f24bc54f098693f54a","node_id":"C_kwDOTgojFdoAKDkwNDQ1NzE3M2QxMmYxYzg4NTRjNzRmMjRiYzU0ZjA5ODY5M2Y1NGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/network-analyzer-cw/commit/436c54651f1551cb4cc3375760aa4e03699dc12f","sha":"436c54651f1551cb4cc3375760aa4e03699dc12f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/network-analyzer-cw/commits/436c54651f1551cb4cc3375760aa4e03699dc12f"}],"sha":"904457173d12f1c8854c74f24bc54f098693f54a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/network-analyzer-cw/commits/904457173d12f1c8854c74f24bc54f098693f54a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/network-analyzer-cw/commits/436c54651f1551cb4cc3375760aa4e03699dc12f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T20:41:12Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T20:41:12Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"feat: open the analyzer form through the host''s modal-launcher slot\n\nThe ''Analyze Network'' form is now a declarative ''modal-launcher''\nresource (AnalyzerModal, host-rendered per cytoscape-web #690), opened\nvia apis.resource.openModal(''analyzer'') from both launchers:\n\n- AppMenuItem drops its dropdown-lifetime workaround: the modal lives\n  outside the dropdown''s subtree, so the registration flips to\n  closeOnAction: true and the item is just a MenuItem again — no local\n  dialog state, no unused handleClose. The old closeOnAction: false\n  dance existed only because a dropdown close unmounted the dialog and\n  silently killed the in-flight analysis Worker.\n- MainPanel''s ''New Analysis...'' opens the same modal and loses its\n  duplicated newAnalysis state and AnalyzerDialog instance.\n- AnalyzerDialog.tsx is deleted; AnalyzerModal renders only the dialog\n  contents (the host shell provides sizing, inert backdrop/Escape, and\n  the structural Close ''X'', replacing the hand-rolled close button).\n- @cytoscape-web/api-types switches to the file: link to the sibling\n  cytoscape-web checkout for the new slot types, until 1.0.0-beta.5 is\n  published (note left in package.json).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9045ebb1fcbe78e56c218897d39d6be6f28f748","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/network-analyzer-cw/git/trees/b9045ebb1fcbe78e56c218897d39d6be6f28f748"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/network-analyzer-cw/git/commits/436c54651f1551cb4cc3375760aa4e03699dc12f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"htt