html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/network-analyzer-cw/commits/f212de40fb54ce127ed55736160a96f5343924e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T20:53:47Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T20:53:47Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"Convert the build from webpack to Vite via @cytoscape-web/app-runtime\n\nReplaces webpack.config.js with a defineCyWebApp-based vite.config.ts, so\nthe production artifact carries no hardcoded host URLs: the host injects\nits own remoteEntry.js location at load time, and chunks resolve relative\nto wherever the app is deployed.\n\n- App identity (id, name, version, port 5556) now lives once in the\n  package.json `cyweb` block, read via virtual:cyweb-app-meta.\n- The analysis web worker is inlined (?worker&inline) in production\n  builds and loaded through a same-origin Blob import shim in dev,\n  working cross-origin and under any base path with no hardcoded origins\n  (replaces the separate webpack worker compiler + importScripts blob).\n- Panel icons are local SvgIcon wrappers; @mui/icons-material would\n  bundle a second MUI copy past the shared singletons and fail the SDK''s\n  no-shared-payload gate.\n- react-chart-editor''s tree reaches the banned @emotion/* namespace two\n  ways: react-select''s @emotion/cache (only used by its never-rendered\n  NonceProvider) is aliased to a throwing stub, and styled-components''\n  four tiny @emotion utility packages are vendored under\n  src/vendor/emotion/ (MIT, provenance headers) and aliased.\n- draft-js and friends need Node''s `global`: shimmed to globalThis via\n  `define`, plus optimizeDeps.rolldownOptions.transform.define for the\n  Vite 8 / rolldown dev pre-bundle.\n- react-chart-editor''s CJS default import may arrive as the exports\n  object depending on bundler interop; PlotDialog unwraps it.\n- Verified with cyweb-app verify (27 checks), unit tests, and end-to-end\n  in the cytoscape-web host: dev-server install and a production dist/\n  served under a subpath, both running a worker analysis and opening the\n  Plotly histogram editor.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ecea5fb3bdff142f79390d2f155a265c1f4c77a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/network-analyzer-cw/git/trees/ecea5fb3bdff142f79390d2f155a265c1f4c77a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/network-analyzer-cw/git/commits/f212de40fb54ce127ed55736160a96f5343924e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/ow