6-09-30.md (değiştirilmeden; başa\n  arşiv notu eklendi).\n- STRUCTURE.md: kök dizindeki her öğenin ne olduğu, uygulamanın ona bağlı olup\n  olmadığı, ajanın dokunup dokunamayacağı.\n- scripts/ci/check-root-map.mjs + CI adımı: haritada olmayan kök öğe = kırmızı.\n- .ai/ (eski ajan çalışma notları) → docs/archive/ai-memory/","tree":{"sha":"825f9e83dab931a5e65768534e60e9bc3995b405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cicicarscom-pixel/flow/git/trees/825f9e83dab931a5e65768534e60e9bc3995b405"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cicicarscom-pixel/flow/git/commits/6ac5e1dc52bf6b8035b9e47b59510d65bc9b4916","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/241664905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/volkanakbulut73-cmyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/volkanakbulut73-cmyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/volkanakbulut73-cmyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/volkanakbulut73-cmyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/volkanakbulut73-cmyk","id":241664905,"login":"volkanakbulut73-cmyk","node_id":"U_kgDODmeDiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/volkanakbulut73-cmyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/volkanakbulut73-cmyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/volkanakbulut73-cmyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/volkanakbulut73-cmyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/volkanakbulut73-cmyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/volkanakbulut73-cmyk","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cicicarscom-pixel/flow/commit/6ac5e1dc52bf6b8035b9e47b59510d65bc9b4916","node_id":"C_kwDOTgvA_toAKDZhYzVlMWRjNTJiZjZiODAzNWI5ZTQ3YjU5NTEwZDY1YmM5YjQ5MTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cicicarscom-pixel/flow/commit/3801ad9f1ec6f0559a98242d0c59bd39f7c0daeb","sha":"3801ad9f1ec6f0559a98242d0c59bd39f7c0daeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cicicarscom-pixel/flow/commits/3801ad9f1ec6f0559a98242d0c59bd39f7c0daeb"}],"sha":"6ac5e1dc52bf6b8035b9e47b59510d65bc9b4916","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cicicarscom-pixel/flow/commits/6ac5e1dc52bf6b8035b9e47b59510d65bc9b4916"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cicicarscom-pixel/flow/commits/3801ad9f1ec6f0559a98242d0c59bd39f7c0daeb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T22:22:19Z","email":"claude@workigom.local","name":"Claude (Workigom)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T22:38:26Z","email":"volkanakbulut73@gmail.com","name":"volkanakbulut73-cmyk"},"message":"ci: Faz B — gerçek kontroller, BOM temizliği, ölü şablon dosyaları\n\naa2b34d''deki scripts/ci/check-names.sh kaynak kodda ''SyntaxError'' METNİ\narıyordu; hiçbir şeyi kontrol etmiyordu. Yerine:\n- check-names.sh: tsc ile tanımsız isim (TS2304/2552/18004/2451), sözdizimi\n  (TS1005/1109/1128/1161/17002/17008) ve bulunamayan göreli kod modülü\n  (TS2307). Bilinmeyen seçenek = kontrol çalışmadı = hata. 30.09''da çöken üç\n  sürümü ve aa2b34d''deki yanlış import''u yakaladığı doğrulandı.\n- check-bom.sh, check-assets.mjs (görsel/medya başvuruları), i18n-parity.mjs\n  (+ bilinçli istisnalar), JSON geçerliliği; .github/workflows/ci.yml.\n- BOM: 28 dosyanın başındaki görünmez karakter kaldırıldı (içerik aynı).\n- Ölü Expo şablonu: web-badge, hint-row, collapsible, themed-view,\n  themed-text, use-theme (hiçbir ekrandan çağrılmıyor; use-theme var olmayan\n  ''../core''u import ediyordu).\n- .editorconfig sadeleşti: yalnız charset = utf-8 (BOM''suz).","tree":{"sha":"65d4a97bd99560317de49694514587be3770984f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cicicarscom-pixel/flow/git/trees/65d4a97bd99560317de49694514587be3770984f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cicicarscom-pixel/flow/git/co