_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/commits/669832a6ca6d845f38acf798dcfd5234da76b3de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T01:05:09Z","email":"juanmguirre@gmail.com","name":"Juan Manuel Aguirre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T01:05:09Z","email":"juanmguirre@gmail.com","name":"Juan Manuel Aguirre"},"message":"feat(inmuebles): mini mapa de ubicación en el detalle del inmueble\n\n- Backend: GET /inmuebles/publicos/{id} expone latitud/longitud (nullable)\n  en InmueblePublicoResponse — el detalle nunca las tenía, solo el listado\n  (HU-010).\n- Frontend: nuevo componente InmuebleMiniMapa (un solo marcador, sin\n  popup, scrollWheelZoom deshabilitado para no secuestrar el scroll de la\n  página, zoom 16 a nivel de calle) integrado en InmuebleDetallePublicoPage.\n  Sin coordenadas, la sección simplemente no se muestra.\n- openspec: change mini-mapa-detalle-inmueble implementado y archivado;\n  specs de inmuebles/inmuebles-mapa-ui sincronizadas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd0d8e4e6cc2a49a0e8766496065cfaa0d6172c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/git/trees/cd0d8e4e6cc2a49a0e8766496065cfaa0d6172c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/git/commits/669832a6ca6d845f38acf798dcfd5234da76b3de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54722069?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/follow