sts{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juanma1000","id":54722069,"login":"juanma1000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NzIyMDY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/commits/3aef5821a944b1a5b5bb6c7b6ba6175a79067fd7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T17:14:14Z","email":"juanmguirre@gmail.com","name":"Juan Manuel Aguirre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T17:14:14Z","email":"juanmguirre@gmail.com","name":"Juan Manuel Aguirre"},"message":"chore(openspec): archive HU-004/005/009, sync identidad/seguro-arrendamiento/firma-contrato specs\n\nAll three changes fully implemented (36/36, 35/35, 41/41 tasks), 0\nregressions, manual curl verification done end-to-end across the chain\n(identidad -> seguro -> firma-contrato).\n\nSyncs delta specs into openspec/specs/{identidad,seguro-arrendamiento,\nfirma-contrato}/spec.md (new capabilities) and appends the\nidentidad_verificada requirement to the existing usuarios spec.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4139443396296bc52f75f06da18bfedf4ed5292c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/git/trees/4139443396296bc52f75f06da18bfedf4ed5292c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/git/commits/3aef5821a944b1a5b5bb6c7b6ba6175a79067fd7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54722069?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juanma1000","id":54722069,"login":"juanma1000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NzIyMDY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juanma1000/rentame/commit/3aef5821a944b1a5b5bb6c7b6ba6175a79067fd7","node_id":"C_kwDOTgvLHNoAKDNhZWY1ODIxYTk0NGIxYTViNWJiNmM3YjZiYTYxNzVhNzkwNjdmZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juanma1000/rentame/commit/fb99a9e9412ad168297f009fc9864cb5356e2c2f","sha":"fb99a9e9412ad168297f009fc9864cb5356e2c2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/commits/fb99a9e9412ad168297f009fc9864cb5356e2c2f"}],"sha":"3aef5821a944b1a5b5bb6c7b6ba6175a79067fd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/commits/3aef5821a944b1a5b5bb6c7b6ba6175a79067fd7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54722069?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juanma1000","id":54722069,"login":"juanma1000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NzIyMDY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/commits/fb99a9e9412ad168297f009fc9864cb5356e2c2f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T17:14:02Z","email":"juanmguirre@gmail.com","name":"Juan Manuel Aguirre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T17:14:02Z","email":"juanmguirre@gmail.com","name":"Juan Manuel Aguirre"},"message":"feat(firma-contrato): firma electrónica del contrato de arrendamiento (HU-009)\n\nNueva HU no numerada en el PRD original: se separó de HU-005 en sesión de\nexploración porque la firma electrónica es una integración técnica\nindependiente (webhook, estados de contrato) con su propio diseño.\n\nNuevo dominio backend/firma_contrato/ (hexagonal, mismo patrón que\nseguro_arrendamiento/identidad/agencias/inmuebles/usuarios): dos aggregates\n— Contrato (borrador/enviado_a_firma/firmado/rechazado/expirado) y\nArrendamientoActivo, creado solo cuando el contrato se firma. Puerto\nProveedorFirmaElectronicaPort con FakeAdapter (dev/test) y ViafirmaAdapter\n(prod). Rentame genera el contenido legal del contrato con un template\npropio; el proveedor solo gestiona el proceso de firma.\n\nProveedor elegido: Viafirma — presencia y contenido legal específico para\nColombia (Ley 527 de 1999) frente a Docusign/Zoho Sign, que ofrecen firma\nelectrónica genérica sin respaldo de entidad certificadora colombiana.\nContrato real de integración pendiente de confirmación comercial, aislado\ndetrás del puerto de dominio.\n\nGate real sobre PolizaArrendamiento.estado == aprobada (HU-005). Si el\ncontrato se rechaza o expira, la póliza queda huérfana sin cancelación\nautomática (decisión explícita, fuera de alcance). ArrendamientoActivo es\nel gate que consumirá HU-006 (pago mensual, aún no construida).\n\n39 tests nuevos, suite completa 318 tests sin regresiones.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"47fe4b1e7451154a804307333db530020fdf8603","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/git/trees/47fe4b1e7451154a804307333db530020fdf8603"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/git/commits/fb99a9e9412ad168297f009fc9864cb5356e2c2f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54722069?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juanma1000","id":54722069,"login":"juanma1000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NzIyMDY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juanma1000/rentame/commit/fb99a9e9412ad168297f009fc9864cb5356e2c2f","node_id":"C_kwDOTgvLHNoAKGZiOTlhOWU5NDEyYWQxNjgyOTdmMDA5ZmM5ODY0Y2I1MzU2ZTJjMmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juanma1000/rentame/commit/90bae982d816b0c023b90de4e82063995e2ecc4d","sha":"90bae982d816b0c023