b.com/users/juanma1000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/commits/4073b00b8a38927f807c2ddcce70531b0484db61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T02:23:49Z","email":"juanmguirre@gmail.com","name":"Juan Manuel Aguirre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T02:23:49Z","email":"juanmguirre@gmail.com","name":"Juan Manuel Aguirre"},"message":"fix: /mis-inmuebles rendered a blank page for an inquilino session\n\nPropertyRoutes only had a \"lista\" branch for role=\"propietario\" or\n\"agente\"; any other role (inquilino is a valid, registrable role since\nHU-008) matched neither, rendering nothing inside the wrapper div — no\nerror thrown, no failed request, just an empty page. Went unnoticed\nuntil BusquedaPublicaShellPage''s session-aware header started sending\nany authenticated visitor straight to /mis-inmuebles.\n\nAdds a fallback message for roles with no inmuebles-management view\ninstead of silently rendering blank.","tree":{"sha":"f167513031860b3e6e7641cd86ec9f0c234187b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/git/trees/f167513031860b3e6e7641cd86ec9f0c234187b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/git/commits/4073b00b8a38927f807c2ddcce70531b0484db61","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54722069?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juanma1000","id":54722069,"login":"juanma1000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NzIyMDY5","organizations_url":"https://ap