t":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T02:26:06Z","email":"juanmguirre@gmail.com","name":"Juan Manuel Aguirre"},"message":"feat: agente publish/manage UI for inmuebles-app (HU-002)\n\nAdds the propietario-selector to PublicarInmueblePage (shown only for\nagente sessions, sourced from GET /agencias/mia/propietarios), and a\nnew InmueblesGestionadosPage for an agente''s own portfolio view\n(read + edit + publish entry points, same optional-props pattern as\nMisInmueblesPage).\n\nWires PropertyRoutes to pick the right default view by role\n(MisInmueblesPage for propietario, InmueblesGestionadosPage for\nagente) — without this, an agente session would have hit\nMisInmueblesPage''s propietario-only endpoint and gotten a 401.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2fb5cfe7e6da31d0a6066882a14da917f42a240c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/git/trees/2fb5cfe7e6da31d0a6066882a14da917f42a240c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/git/commits/10f25f9825a6f4b0eacbfed315b6e240e4e8527c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54722069?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juanma1000","id":54722069,"login":"juanma1000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NzIyMDY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https: