47Z","email":"juanmguirre@gmail.com","name":"Juan Manuel Aguirre"},"message":"feat: extend inmuebles for publication/management by agente (HU-002)\n\nExtends publicar_inmueble/editar_inmueble/cambiar_disponibilidad to\naccept an agente acting on behalf of a propietario with an active\nagencia<->propietario relacion, plus a new listar_inmuebles_gestionados\nuse case and GET /inmuebles/gestionados endpoint.\n\nAll cross-domain authorization (does this agente''s agencia have an\nactive relacion with this propietario?) lives in inmuebles'' API layer\nrouter, not in its application/domain layers, which stay agencias-free\n— preserving the one-way dependency direction fixed in hu-007''s design.\nAuthorization is agencia-level (any member, not just the original\npublisher); inmueble.agente_id never changes on edit — it''s audit\ndata, not an authorization signal.\n\nNew get_current_publicador auth dependency (additive, doesn''t touch\nget_current_propietario/get_current_agente). RelacionResponse in\nagencias gains propietario_email so the frontend can render a\nreadable picker (schema-only change, no application/domain touched).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4974e0bbec7a6c33c335dca38c74cdec64c4bd30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/git/trees/4974e0bbec7a6c33c335dca38c74cdec64c4bd30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/git/commits/cae4e8cb076b4757653dbe18db89a1b1879947c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54722069?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/