anuel Aguirre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T01:20:07Z","email":"juanmguirre@gmail.com","name":"Juan Manuel Aguirre"},"message":"feat: bootstrap shell host and @rentame/auth for HU-001\n\nAdds the frontend microfrontends monorepo (npm workspaces, Rspack +\nModule Federation 2.0): the shell host with a global router and a\nprivate layout gated by session, and the @rentame/auth singleton\npackage (AuthProvider, useAuth, AuthGuard, JWT session utilities).\n\nIncludes a dev-only token-paste login screen since no HU covers\nusuarios registration/login yet.\n\nShared docs (architecture.md, HU-001 acceptance criteria, the hu-001\nOpenSpec change artifacts) travel with this branch for PR context.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08adb4a87c5084ba562e160b25eaa5ea11cdc5a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/git/trees/08adb4a87c5084ba562e160b25eaa5ea11cdc5a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/git/commits/94cd4217de3ecb33df480826f8df0583cf6ca054","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54722069?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juanma1000","id":54722069,"login":"juanma1000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NzIyMDY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juanma1000/rentame/commit/94cd4217de3ecb33df480826f8df0583cf6ca054","node_id":"C_kwDOTgvLHNoAKDk0Y2Q0MjE3ZGUzZWNiMzNkZjQ4MDgyNmY4ZGYwNTgzY2Y2Y2EwNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juanma1000/rentame/commit/322e5755d6f09ab7ddfd8c73a9fd5109b98f6a90","sha":"322e5755d6f09ab7ddfd8c73a9fd5109b98f6a90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/commits/322e5755d6f09ab7ddfd8c73a9fd5109b98f6a90"}],"sha":"94cd4217de3ecb33df480826f8df0583cf6ca054","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/commits/94cd4217de3ecb33df480826f8df0583cf6ca054"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54722069?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juanma1000","id":54722069,"login":"juanma1000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NzIyMDY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/commits/cddd632eb1e86a12e6c388a4ff22652c48927177/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T01:18:33Z","email":"juanmguirre@gmail.com","name":"Juan Manuel Aguirre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T01:18:33Z","email":"juanmguirre@gmail.com","name":"Juan Manuel Aguirre"},"message":"feat: implement inmuebles backend domain for HU-001\n\nAdds the inmuebles domain (hexagonal architecture) with publish, edit,\navailability toggle and owner listing use cases, PostgreSQL persistence,\nS3/MinIO photo storage, and the API layer — plus a minimal usuarios/JWT\nstub needed to test ownership since no auth HU exists yet.\n\nIncludes CORS middleware and a UsuarioORM-mapper-registration fix, both\nfound by manual curl testing against the running server (mandatory step\nper openspec-tasks-mandatory-steps.md) rather than by the test suite.\n\nAlso updates architecture.md (microfrontends split, photo upload\nmechanism resolved to backend-proxied multipart) and marks HU-001''s\nacceptance criteria, per the hu-001 OpenSpec change artifacts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cc4995f938981eba09e10a9f15beebc8da62111b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/git/trees/cc4995f938981eba09e10a9f15beebc8da62111b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanma1000/rentame/git/commits/cddd632eb1e86a12e6c388a4ff22652c48927177","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54722069?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juanma1000","id":54722069,"login":"juanma1000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NzIyMDY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanma1000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_ur