05?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/8a4593855f7f30f87fb50ded1d683f69c22ec4bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T20:57:53Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T20:57:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(types): mirror SelfDeploymentResult in full (#28)\n\nThe interface declared status and remediation behind an\n[key: string]: unknown index signature. That reads as complete but types\nevery other field as unknown -- ten of them, including isContainerized,\nwhich is the field doctor.selfDeployment() exists to report. A consumer\nreading it got neither a value nor a compile error.\n\nSelfDeploymentStatus was also missing the cgroup-controllers-incomplete\nvariant, so an exhaustive switch over it would silently lose a case.\n\nBoth are now pinned in the contract test. Verified it fails against the old\nshape, so this class of drift cannot recur silently for these two types --\nthough the general gap that allowed it stands (#27): ContainerManagerApi and\nmost of the doctor surface are still unasserted.\n\nFound while deleting signalk-questdb''s hand-written type mirror: its own\ndeclaration was correct and disagreed with ours, which is the opposite of\nwhat a mirror is for.\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"44522406ab8a76b8ac061bbe0a4f04480f2a53cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/trees/44522406ab8a76b8ac061bbe0a4f04480f2a53cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/commits/8a4593855f7f30f87fb50ded1d683f69c22ec4bc","verification":{"payload":"tree 44522406ab8a76b8ac061bbe0a4f04480f2a53cc\nparent dc7c088d04396b365391ffb85e176e36e225cba3\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1786395473 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786395473 +1200\n\nfix(types): mirror SelfDeploymentResult in full (#28)\n\nThe interface declared status and remediation behind an\n[key: string]: unknown index signature. That reads as complete but types\nevery other field as unknown -- ten of them, including isContainerized,\nwhich is the field doctor.selfDeployment() exists to report. A consumer\nreading it got neither a value nor a compile error.\n\nSelfDeploymentStatus was also missing the cgroup-controllers-incomplete\nvariant, so an exhaustive switch over it would silently lose a case.\n\nBoth are now pinned in the contract test. Verified it fails against the old\nshape, so this class of drift cannot recur silently for these two types --\nthough the general gap that allowed it stands (#27): ContainerManagerApi and\nmost of the doctor surface are still unasserted.\n\nFound while deleting signalk-questdb''s hand-written type mirror: its own\ndeclaration was correct and disagreed with ours, which is the opposite of\nwhat a mirror is for.\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqejtRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9EYQAJimkrD+lloKWHWxBLp/nw