te_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/dc7c088d04396b365391ffb85e176e36e225cba3","node_id":"C_kwDOTgx649oAKGRjN2MwODhkMDQzOTZiMzY1MzkxZmZiODVlMTc2ZTM2ZTIyNWNiYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/cf205e685786526e831090a54d45396b5fdc446f","sha":"cf205e685786526e831090a54d45396b5fdc446f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/cf205e685786526e831090a54d45396b5fdc446f"}],"sha":"dc7c088d04396b365391ffb85e176e36e225cba3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/dc7c088d04396b365391ffb85e176e36e225cba3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/cf205e685786526e831090a54d45396b5fdc446f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T19:39:36Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T19:39:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(types): mirror getContainerNofile and NofileLimits (#25)\n\nsignalk-container 1.25.3 added getContainerNofile(name), which reports the\nnofile limits a container is ACTUALLY running with. It is how a plugin\nclears a stale \"capped by the host\" ulimit advisory once the container does\nget the full requested limit -- signalk-questdb uses exactly this, and the\ngap forced it to hand-declare the method and intersect it with the mirrored\nContainerManagerApi. That is the drift the mirror exists to prevent.\n\nOptional, so consumers feature-detect it, matching getLogs and the other\nversion-gated members.\n\nThe contract test pins NofileLimits structurally against the canonical type,\nso it cannot silently diverge; the dev signalk-container is already 1.25.3,\nso the assertion is verifying against the real thing rather than a stub.\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"14ae8cb219cd683277bfce5aef6be8a106184882","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/trees/14ae8cb219cd683277bfce5aef6be8a106184882"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/commits/cf205e685786526e831090a54d45396b5fdc446f","verification":{"payload":"tree 14ae8cb219cd683277bfce5aef6be8a106184882\nparent dc26d2459d53179257f95c5199b8574a23c8bf81\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1786390776 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786390776 +1200\n\nfeat(types): mirror getContainerNofile and NofileLimits (#25)\n\nsignalk-container 1.25.3 added getContainerNofile(name), which reports the\nnofile limits a container is ACTUALLY running with. It is how a plugin\nclears a stale \"capped by the host\" ulimit advisory once the container does\nget the full requested limit -- signalk-questdb uses exactly this, and the\ngap forced it to hand-declare the method and intersect it with the mirrored\nContainerManagerApi. That is the drift the mirror exists to prevent.\n\nOptional, so consumers feature-detect it, matching getLogs and the other\nversion-gated members.\n\nThe contract test pins NofileLimits structurally against the canonical type,\nso it cannot silently diverge; the dev signalk-container is already 1.25.3,\nso the assertion is verifying against the real thing rather than a stub.\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqeij4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAY/cQABpFlEDoHBKjnZrt8wu18zuQ\nD6dyvtekk5XkaNFm43q+llizSfXMQcDR1ZJ/rOBS1T127c8mvF1v3/LUdggqd4kt\ncKrvErq9y3Bi2vcHxM8KjNryA0uRCc/+MAm3QwE5erBofUvvJC6mJw23QM6xagCh\nAYAZFpi+wApepQ7jb6k8M8qsmceZ8gFdTmu4SJcbeN8vBJNXFUOyuh+i1gP7QVIg\nMw1uLB6zuZZQWhOrNUkO+5JvSYQtHtjIl/LDQGZLsRPxAzNf3DPBJGwwR8+whV0O\n2XhkF0/a0DP3Bw5bbG2G2YDvoVy69pPoTr4IVgW2tjO3rRESoMYRIjqO9SaNTeJz\nUzt861A1C1qB+YihV1YmHvuFEFSsxGi0RpSlTCuAya5uEdKFIzp4VhFGD7xOEic5\nS5O6rhIYSy8pVBC4eO8ZARydeKPg8rZ0VqxWFpyAd2IsUrFhOg27OOytXNf0GtTx\np2QxYnv2hRq1fsb9aQqfADm6IvBUqXeERR/HKznJExljR+T1B/oZeKyOi5bMrCfQ\niv3MVAKcWrq9BilUTG8LT+/kqdR7P0koOHJ+t3vmFiQhUjrfRABY/GKb9Bu0vb0S\nTZMyrSQcr5IeMhtVIqMrLWNwwGBpddDYoxHNttyP95TNZ29ntT4s7rRsTGvHa5M4\nhIV2VK6VMBjvzwgfD8x5\n=sKgb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-10T19:39:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.c