ub.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/f92cf13ac37555a02afc27104b698134df21a413","node_id":"C_kwDOTgx649oAKGY5MmNmMTNhYzM3NTU1YTAyYWZjMjcxMDRiNjk4MTM0ZGYyMWE0MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/429b2d9ef43f5ece5cfd100086965cf7d957e8cb","sha":"429b2d9ef43f5ece5cfd100086965cf7d957e8cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/429b2d9ef43f5ece5cfd100086965cf7d957e8cb"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/6ac7e06546149a876d55b05e1e4de5d2349c92d3","sha":"6ac7e06546149a876d55b05e1e4de5d2349c92d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/6ac7e06546149a876d55b05e1e4de5d2349c92d3"}],"sha":"f92cf13ac37555a02afc27104b698134df21a413","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/f92cf13ac37555a02afc27104b698134df21a413"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/6ac7e06546149a876d55b05e1e4de5d2349c92d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T20:58:33Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T21:00:02Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"message":"docs: add AGENTS.md with repo conventions, CLAUDE.md pointer\n\nCaptures the conventions and traps this repo has already paid for, so they\ndo not have to be rediscovered.\n\nAGENTS.md is the single source of truth; CLAUDE.md is a short pointer to it\nrather than a second copy that can drift.\n\nContents worth calling out:\n\n- Release process: version bumps ship as their own chore(release): PR and\n  the tag goes on main after merge, never mixed into a feat/fix PR. v0.3.0\n  is recorded as the cautionary example -- its bump rode inside a feat: PR\n  and the tag landed on an unrelated fix: merge, so nothing at the tag says\n  \"release\". v0.2.2 shows the intended shape.\n- Publishing is OIDC trusted publishing, not a token. Any npm token in a\n  local ~/.npmrc is used for reads only and is not in the release path.\n- The ~/.npmrc package-lock=false trap, including why it is confusing: npm\n  version does rewrite an existing lockfile''s version fields, so a bump\n  looks complete while a dependency change from the same session is still\n  missing.\n- publish.yml parses CHANGELOG.md by the exact heading \"# v<tag>\"; a\n  missing section is a hard failure of the release job.\n- Angular-style commits and PR titles, hyphenated branch names.\n\nClaims here were verified against the repo rather than assumed: the\nno-Node-builtin property by grep, the createElement emit by inspecting\ndist/, and the absence of CodeRabbit PR review by checking that all three\nrecent PRs have zero app activity (the GitHub app is not installed; review\nis CLI-only).\n\nNeither file ships to npm -- the package.json files allowlist governs.","tree":{"sha":"07cd51a85de2e7ff6818b82942846f2a6acfe30e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/trees/07cd51a85de2e7ff6818b82942846f2a6acfe30e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/commits/6ac7e06546149a876d55b05e1e4de5d2349c92d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/6ac7e06546149a876d55b05e1e4de5d2349c92d3","node_id":"C_kwDOTgx649oAKDZhYzdlMDY1NDYxNDlhODc2ZDU1YjA1ZTFlNGRlNWQyMzQ5YzkyZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/429b2d9ef43f5ece5cfd100086965cf7d957e8cb","sha":"429b2d9ef43f5ece5cfd100086965cf7d957e8cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk