?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken","id":148426,"login":"hoeken","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODQyNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/2360c8513e24bddea3d00ca6bcb9bd102c94860d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T19:48:18Z","email":"hoeken@gmail.com","name":"Zach Hoeken"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T19:48:18Z","email":"hoeken@gmail.com","name":"Zach Hoeken"},"message":"feat: add config-panel UI entrypoint (signalk-container-helper/ui)\n\nThe reference plugins (signalk-grafana, signalk-questdb, mayara-server-\nsignalk-plugin) each hand-copy the same React config panel pieces: the\ninline-style vocabulary, container status card, image-version dropdown,\nupdate check/apply row, and fetch-and-poll plumbing. Package them as a\nbrowser-side subpath export so panels can share one tested copy.\n\nShipped as tsc-compiled React.createElement ESM (no JSX) because the\nstandard panel webpack configs exclude node_modules from babel-loader;\n`react` (optional peer, >=17) resolves to the Admin UI''s Module\nFederation shared singleton. Verified by bundling a sample panel\nthrough signalk-grafana''s exact webpack + federation setup. The main\nentry stays Node-only and zero-dependency.\n\nIncludes the version-dropdown view logic generalized from mayara\n(configurable floating tags and slice counts, structured and legacy\n/api/versions shapes, running-tag fallback so a rate-limited GitHub\nfetch can never blank the controlled select), hooks that encode the\npanels'' hard-won polling lessons (self-scheduling, stale-response\ndrops, non-2xx body parsing), and formatUpdateMessage typed against\nUpdateCheckResult to match registerUpdateRoutes'' contract.","tree":{"sha":"9cbd78054b5620aa6c55dfe74603707e7a5e8add","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/trees/9cbd78054b5620aa6c55dfe74603707e7a5e8add"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/commits/2360c8513e24bddea3d00ca6bcb9bd102c94860d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/148426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken","id":148426,"login":"hoeken","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODQyNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoeken","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/2360c8513e24bddea3d00ca6bcb9bd102c94860d","node_id":"C_kwDOTgx649oAKDIzNjBjODUxM2UyNGJkZGVhM2QwMGNhNmJjYjliZDEwMmM5