108189bed590ba460867668a00c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/35ed51a5e4539108189bed590ba460867668a00c","node_id":"C_kwDOTgx649oAKDM1ZWQ1MWE1ZTQ1MzkxMDgxODliZWQ1OTBiYTQ2MDg2NzY2OGEwMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/fdccbc5e1686790a90a16546e747296623299506","sha":"fdccbc5e1686790a90a16546e747296623299506","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/fdccbc5e1686790a90a16546e747296623299506"}],"sha":"35ed51a5e4539108189bed590ba460867668a00c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/35ed51a5e4539108189bed590ba460867668a00c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/fdccbc5e1686790a90a16546e747296623299506/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T01:32:47Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T01:46:22Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"message":"ci: add CI and release workflows plus dependabot\n\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml — run ci-lint, build, and test on every push\n  and pull request (Node 24, ubuntu). Lightweight library CI, not the\n  SignalK plugin-ci reusable workflow (this is a library, not a plugin\n  installed into a server).\n- .github/workflows/publish.yml — tag-triggered (v*) GitHub Release +\n  npm publish --provenance, mirroring signalk-container. Needs an\n  NPM_TOKEN repository secret.\n- .github/dependabot.yml — weekly npm + github-actions updates, grouped;\n  \\@types/node pinned to the Node 24 line.","tree":{"sha":"4b0c78736045ef17bdcc1096bfa6da57b4327564","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/trees/4b0c78736045ef17bdcc1096bfa6da57b4327564"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/commits/fdccbc5e1686790a90a16546e747296623299506","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/fdccbc5e1686790a90a16546e747296623299506","node_id":"C_kwDOTgx649oAKGZkY2NiYzVlMTY4Njc5MGE5MGExNjU0NmU3NDcyOTY2MjMyOTk1MDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/4617538dfd61ac4c9506fb8a19378f36424731cd","sha":"4617538dfd61ac4c9506fb8a19378f36424731cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/4617538dfd61ac4c9506fb8a19378f36424731cd"}],"sha":"fdccbc5e1686790a90a16546e747296623299506","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/fdccbc5e1686790a90a16546e747296623299506"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/4617538dfd61ac4c9506fb8a19378f36424731cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T01:32:38Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T01:32:38Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"message":"chore: add eslint + prettier and enforce LF\n\nThe repo had no linting or formatting tooling. Add eslint (flat config,\ntypescript-eslint) + prettier with lint/format/ci-lint scripts, matching\nsignalk-container''s setup, and a .gitattributes forcing LF so Windows CI\ncheckouts don''t fail prettier --check on CRLF.\n\nThe bulk of the diff is the one-time prettier reformat of the existing\nsources (no prior style config). Two genuine lint fixes ride along: a\nuseless `lastErr` initializer in http.ts, and a stale\n`eslint-disable no-var` in the globalThis augmentation.","tree":{"sha":"bc25584953fbfd11d46a523a072ab99197989047","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/trees/bc25584953fbfd11d46a523a072ab99197989047"},"url":"https://api.github.