84929a0e5756b7c12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T00:25:52Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T00:25:52Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"message":"test: correct UpdateServiceApi contract rationale, require 1.23.2\n\nThe comment on the _UpdateServiceApi assertion attributed its directional\n(not equal) form to signalk-container''s missing `token` option — but that\ngap was fixed in 1.23.2. Verified against 1.23.2 that exact equality still\ndoes not hold: UpdateServiceApi embeds ContainerRuntimeInfo (via\nsources.*(): VersionSource and register(reg).versionSource), which this\nmirror intentionally softens (optional `isPodmanDockerShim`, no\n`remoteSocketUrl`). So the directional assertion is correct and stays;\nonly its rationale was stale.\n\nBump the signalk-container devDependency to ^1.23.2 (where the option\ntypes the contract relies on are complete) and update the version\nreferences in the docs.","tree":{"sha":"237a0771e5417b2147e87018821f7c579436ec2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/trees/237a0771e5417b2147e87018821f7c579436ec2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/commits/ef0b2ccb8342d7c38b1d5c884929a0e5756b7c12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/ef0b2ccb8342d7c38b1d5c884929a0e5756b7c12","node_id":"C_kwDOTgx649oAKGVmMGIyY2NiODM0MmQ3YzM4YjFkNWM4ODQ5MjlhMGU1NzU2YjdjMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/07ed945909c596db77c33c918b570209a05c2ceb","sha":"07ed945909c596db77c33c918b570209a05c2ceb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/07ed945909c596db77c33c918b570209a05c2ceb"}],"sha":"ef0b2ccb8342d7c38b1d5c884929a0e5756b7c12","url":"https://api.gi