starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/07ed945909c596db77c33c918b570209a05c2ceb","node_id":"C_kwDOTgx649oAKDA3ZWQ5NDU5MDljNTk2ZGI3N2MzM2M5MThiNTcwMjA5YTA1YzJjZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/fd2cc7b9c9feeca48f9830060c689be711501ee2","sha":"fd2cc7b9c9feeca48f9830060c689be711501ee2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/fd2cc7b9c9feeca48f9830060c689be711501ee2"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/15653678a2c3f02cc8f616845b6a250b959fc45d","sha":"15653678a2c3f02cc8f616845b6a250b959fc45d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/15653678a2c3f02cc8f616845b6a250b959fc45d"}],"sha":"07ed945909c596db77c33c918b570209a05c2ceb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/07ed945909c596db77c33c918b570209a05c2ceb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/15653678a2c3f02cc8f616845b6a250b959fc45d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T22:59:54Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T22:59:54Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"message":"test: cover update-service types in the contract check\n\nBump the signalk-container devDependency to ^1.23.1 (which completed the\nsignalk-container/types export with the update-service types) and extend\nthe type-contract check to cover them: UpdateReason, TagKind, and\nVersionSourceResult asserted byte-identical; UpdateRegistration (register\ninput) and UpdateCheckResult (checkOne result) asserted directionally.\n\nVersionSource is directional, not equal — its fetch(runtime) parameter is\nContainerRuntimeInfo, which the mirror intentionally softens.\nUpdateServiceApi is directional too: our mirror types\nsources.githubReleases with a `token` option that the real implementation\naccepts but signalk-container''s own interface under-declares, so ours is a\ncorrect superset. Both are asserted usable rather than forced equal.","tree":{"sha":"076ec3368377720583ee43abb680b9ce4a4a343a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/trees/076ec3368377720583ee43abb680b9ce4a4a343a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/commits/15653678a2c3f02cc8f616845b6a250b959fc45d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/15653678a2c3f02cc8f616845b6a250b959fc45d","node_id":"C_kwDOTgx649oAKDE1NjUzNjc4YTJjM2YwMmNjOGY2MTY4NDViNmEyNTBiOTU5ZmM0NWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/32a9556111fa233d63f9a8c2dc2fa095f701fc93","sha":"32a9556111fa233d63f9a8c2dc2fa095f701fc93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/32a9556111fa233d63f9a8c2dc2fa095f701fc93"}],"sha":"15653678a2c3f02cc8f616845b6a250b959fc45d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/15653678a2c3f02cc8f616845b6a250b959fc45d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/32a9556111fa233d63f9a8c2dc2fa095f701fc93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T21:06:05Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T21:06:05Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"message":"test: assert type mirror matches signalk-container/types\n\nAdd a tsc-checked contract (test/types-contract.test-d.ts, wired into\nthe test script via tsconfig.test.json) that fails the build if this\nlibrary''s hand-written type mirror drifts from signalk-container''s\npublished \"signalk-container/types\" surface (> 1.23.0). The mirror\nstays defined locally, so consumers take no transitive signalk-container\ndependency; only this dev-time check imports the canonical types.\n\nData shapes (ConsumerManifest, HistoryEntry, ContainerState) are\nasserted byte-identical; boundary shapes (ContainerConfig in,\nContainerInfo/VolumeIssue out, ContainerResourceLimits in) are asserted\nassignable in the direction data actually crosses the manager boundary,\npreserving the intentional optionality divergence that drives\nfeature-detection.","tree":{"sha":"34a47cabd2003db8c33c3658d04557b9a9289a81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/trees/34a47cabd2003db8c33c3658d04557b9a9289a81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/commits/32a9556111fa233d63f9a8c2dc2fa095f701fc93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/32a9556111fa233d63f9a8c2dc2fa095f701fc93","node_id":"C_kwDOTgx649oAKDMyYTk1NTYxMTFmYTIzM2Q2M2Y5YThjMmRjMmZhMDk1ZjcwMWZjOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/c5ac26b7a765eb0ff24591a993392468a551b492","sha":"c5ac26b7a765eb0ff24591a993392468a551b492","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/c5ac26b7a765eb0ff24591a993392468a551b492"}],"sha":"32a9556111fa233d63f9a8c2dc2fa095f701fc93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/32a9556111fa233d63f9a8c2dc2fa095f701fc93"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/c5ac26b7a765eb0ff24591a993392468a551b492/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T21:05:55Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T21:05:55Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"message":"refactor: migrate to ESM and Node 24\n\nSwitch the package to \"type\": \"module\" with NodeNext resolution\n(relative imports now carry .js extensions) and raise the engines floor\nto Node >= 24. ESM/NodeNext is also what lets the library resolve\nsignalk-container''s \"./types\" subpath export, used by the type-contract\ncheck added next.","tree":{"sha":"df39d3b659efc2b33aace474ca7e3a90ef720697","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/trees/df39d3b659efc2b33aace474ca7e3a90ef720697"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/git/commits/c5ac26b7a765eb0ff24591a993392468a551b492","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/c5ac26b7a765eb0ff24591a993392468a551b492","node_id":"C_kwDOTgx649oAKGM1YWMyNmI3YTc2NWViMGZmMjQ1OTFhOTkzMzkyNDY4YTU1MWI0OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commit/fd2cc7b9c9feeca48f9830060c689be711501ee2","sha":"fd2cc7b9c9feeca48f9830060c689be711501ee2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/fd2cc7b9c9feeca48f9830060c689be711501ee2"}],"sha":"c5ac26b7a765eb0ff24591a993392468a551b492","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoeken/signalk-container-helper/commits/c5ac26b7a765eb0ff24591a993392468a551b492"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"ht