 transition failures roll back optimistic state and never leave an unhandled rejection\n- connectivity recovers from unstable; only genuine offline routes to the queue\n- offline replay conflicts open the merge dialog and resolve through the queue\n- server enforces edit authorization at the API boundary (forbidden on a LOCKED note)\n- getNote returns an immutable snapshot; the note refetches when a save lands\n- removed unused imports, fixed the search-debounce leak, enabled strict unused checks","tree":{"sha":"df153578602ceb82e2f4c5de2015b27520a02476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Denishm39/Soulside-FE/git/trees/df153578602ceb82e2f4c5de2015b27520a02476"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Denishm39/Soulside-FE/git/commits/551ebf5eb5542d58272088760bf7740499a70590","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114626435?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Denishm39/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Denishm39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Denishm39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Denishm39/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Denishm39","id":114626435,"login":"Denishm39","node_id":"U_kgDOBtUPgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Denishm39/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Denishm39/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Denishm39/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Denishm39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Denishm39/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Denishm39","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Denishm39/Soulside-FE/commit/551ebf5eb5542d58272088760bf7740499a70590","node_id":"C_kwDOTgzUf9oAKDU1MWViZjVlYjU1NDJkNTgyNzIwODg3