ummary()：\n- 根据 health_check_items 配置（\"数据库\", \"存储空间\", \"目录权限\"）\n- 条件性执行用户选择的检查项（前端 Config.vue 已支持多选）\n- 保持兼容性：默认检查（订阅、站点、下载器、本插件任务）始终执行\n\n更新 _format_health_summary()：\n- name_map 补充映射：database→数据库, storage→存储空间, directory→目录权限\n- 检查结果统一展示格式\n\n验证：\n✓ py_compile 通过\n✓ pyflakes 无警告（删除未使用变量）\n✓ 单测 98 项全过\n✓ npm build 成功\n\n健康巡查现已完整实现：基础 4 项 + 可选 3 项 = 最多 7 项检查\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"631585dc1770f7de55490aaa832a4468a6dde558","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/631585dc1770f7de55490aaa832a4468a6dde558"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/36a756368ec5af91f10945ff586b0e6a2bf85fdf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clone-fan","id":168186446,"login":"clone-fan","node_id":"U_kgDOCgZSTg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/36a756368ec5af91f10945ff586b0e6a2bf85fdf","node_id":"C_kwDOTg5y1doAKDM2YTc1NjM2OGVjNWFmOTFmMTA5NDVmZjU4NmIwZTZhMmJmODVmZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://gi