riptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/e5a19c48ba7851a7d7a8833b4ee08ca3feb6bd70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T08:50:27Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T08:50:27Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"message":"AgentOpsAssistant v1.0.0-P2-2：健康巡查组件化（配置页）\n\n**改进内容**\n1. 在 Config.vue mainTabs 中新增「健康巡查」一级分类\n   - 属于「系统维护」分组\n   - 图标：mdi-heart-pulse-outline\n   - 描述：定期检查系统健康状态（数据库、存储、目录等），发现问题及时通知\n\n2. 在 subTabs 中为 healthcheck 添加二级选项卡\n   - 唯一二级分类 key: ''hc''，显示「健康巡查」\n\n3. 在模板中新增健康巡查配置面板（v-show=\"activeSub === ''hc''\")\n   内容包括：\n   - 启用开关 + 说明文案\n   - Cron 定时设置（健康巡查计划）\n   - 检查项多选框（数据库、存储空间、目录权限）\n   - 汇报并入开关（可选是否把健康检查结果并入每日汇报）\n   - 立即执行按钮（手动触发）\n\n4. 在 watch 中添加 health_check_items 数组处理\n\n5. 新增 healthCheckItems 定义：[''数据库'', ''存储空间'', ''目录权限'']\n\n**前端即装即用**\n✓ npm run build 成功\n✓ py_compile 通过\n✓ pyflakes 通过\n\n**后端待补充**\n- 实现 HealthCheck 类（检查逻辑）\n- 注册 run_health_check API 端点\n- 集成到日报生成逻辑\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"713c581f2ed8978cf1e5779b803cb82bd92062d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/713c581f2ed8978cf1e5779b803cb82bd92062d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/e5a19c48ba7851a7d7a8833b4ee08ca3feb6bd70","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users