rs/clone-fan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/0fbf0f9116a8c82094182f6f5fa604125ca8ae10/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T08:41:11Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T08:41:11Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"message":"AgentOpsAssistant v1.0.0-P2-1：汇报栏目表/列表实现\n\n**改进内容**\n1. 报告部分 reportSections 添加 report_health 与 group/requires 字段\n   - 每个栏目现记录对应组件分类与依赖关系\n   - 如 report_site_increment 依赖 site_stat_enabled，report_health 依赖 health_check_enabled\n\n2. 汇报栏目 UI 从 Grid 切换为 VTable 表格显示\n   - 表格列：栏目名 | 启用勾选 | 组件分类 | 备注\n   - 勾选框具有禁用逻辑：依赖组件未启用时自动禁用\n   - 备注列提示\"需启用对应组件\"\n\n3. Config.vue defaults 已包含 report_health 等字段（前次提交已加）\n\n**验证**\n✓ npm run build 成功（配置组件重新编译）\n✓ py_compile 通过（Python 语法检查）\n✓ pyflakes 通过（代码风格检查）\n\n**下一步**\n- P2-2：健康巡查组件化（HealthCheck 类 + 前端配置页）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"09400f8e648947a3fe86df8c02dc12fab3b87439","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/09400f8e648947a3fe86df8c02dc12fab3b87439"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/0fbf0f9116a8c82094182f6f5fa604125ca8ae10","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clone-fan","id":168186446