criptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/ba77cca238247c741202b7dfe08f073342fc2d1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T08:21:54Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T08:21:54Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"message":"AgentOpsAssistant v1.0.0 系统改进 Phase 1/2\n\n**已完成（P0-P1）：**\n1. P0 通知渠道检查：全量扫描确认所有通知走了正确渠道\n2. P1-仪表盘手动触发重组织：按分组（汇报中心、订阅与站点、下载与媒体、系统维护）组织按钮，每个按钮附说明文案\n3. P1-说明卡片：在配置页内容顶部添加 VAlert，每个一级分类醒目显示说明\n4. P2-后端配置项补充：新增 health_check_enabled/cron/items 和 report_health\n5. P2-前端 defaults 补充：Config.vue 中补充对应的默认值\n\n**已验证：**\n- npm build ✓\n- py_compile ✓\n- pyflakes ✓\n\n**待续（P2-P3）：**\n- 汇报栏目表/列表实现（所有栏目逐个勾选）\n- 健康巡查组件化（后端 HealthCheck 类 + 前端配置页）\n- 下载器助手配置统一\n- 媒体库通知配置统一\n- 单测 + 最终提交\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bfd914cd570899ab552b42aee3f9ecea9f906152","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/bfd914cd570899ab552b42aee3f9ecea9f906152"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/ba77cca238247c741202b7dfe08f073342fc2d1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clone-fan","id":168186446,"login":"clone-fan","node_id":"U_kgDOCgZSTg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/ba77cca238247c741202b7dfe08f073342fc2d1c","node_id":"C_kwDOTg5y1doAKGJhNzdjY2EyMzgyNDdjNzQxMjAyYjdkZmUwOGYwNzMzNDJmYzJkMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/a6116d797650e6bff3816ea21fa74526a0a9864b","sha":"a6116d797650e6bff3816ea21fa74526a0a9864b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/a6116d797650e6bff3816ea21fa74526a0a9864b"}],"sha":"ba77cca238247c741202b7dfe08f073342fc2d1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/ba77cca238247c741202b7dfe08f073342fc2d1c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clone-fan","id":168186446,"login":"clone-fan","node_id":"U_kgDOCgZSTg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/a6116d797650e6bff3816ea21fa74526a0a9864b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T07:45:14Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T07:45:14Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"message":"AgentOpsAssistant v1.0.2：1.0.0-F 审核修复 onlyonce 死开关\n\n- 修复所有「保存后立即运行一次」(onlyonce) 开关此前形同虚设：现真正会在\n  保存后各跑一次对应任务(自动备份/日志清理/插件库更新/订阅提醒)，并自动\n  复位开关防止重载重复触发，异步执行不阻塞插件加载（_fire_onlyonce）。\n- 移除「站点数据统计」里无对应执行动作的「立即运行一次站点统计」死开关\n  （站点数据已在仪表盘饼图实时呈现）。\n- F 审核结论：五大移植功能 app.* 接口/事件/配置项经源码逐项核实，无致命 bug。\n- 单测 98 项全过；py_compile/pyflakes/npm build 全绿，dist 哈希一致。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be2b4503237d207a60ba4fe812cc4a8e55105343","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/be2b4503237d207a60ba4fe812cc4a8e55105343"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/a6116d797650e6bff3816ea21fa74526a0a9864b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clone-fan","id":168186446,"login":"clone-fan","node_id":"U_kgDOCgZSTg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clon