0.0 收尾(订阅提醒 cron 统一 + 仪表盘重排)\n\n1.0.0 是在 E(统一)/F(审核) 未完成时提前打的标，本版补做 E 的关键项：\n\n- 订阅提醒 cron 统一：原「提醒时间(小时 0-23)」改为统一 VCronField；\n  并真正注册「独立订阅提醒推送」定时服务(此前该开关与提醒时间未驱动\n  任何调度，是隐性失效)；新增 run_subscribe_reminder + 立即推送按钮 +\n  /run_subscribe_reminder 接口 + /mpops_subscribe 命令 + 仪表盘任务行。\n- 仪表盘重排：站点数据统计 与「手动触发」左右并排(手动触发模块化、\n  补「订阅提醒」按钮)；模块运行概览 与 最近健康巡查 横向并排。\n- 测试 95 项全过(新增 cron 迁移/显式优先/独立推送)；py_compile/pyflakes/\n  npm build 全绿，dist 哈希一致。\n\n注：尚未完成 1.0.0-E 余下的 cron/格式/交互一致性扫尾 与 1.0.0-F 多方审核，\n完成并验收后才作为真正的 1.0 定稿。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"084e7a3a7d249b3114e174fbd28fe0b40ee52f52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/084e7a3a7d249b3114e174fbd28fe0b40ee52f52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/652973bdd626c94c34da096eface684c6ccee61e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clone-fan","id":168186446,"login":"clone-fan","node_id":"U_kgDOCgZSTg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/652973bdd626c94c34da096eface684c6ccee61e","node_id":"C_kwDOTg5y1doAKDY1Mjk3M2JkZDYyNmM5NGMzNGRhMDk2ZWZhY2U2ODRjNmNjZWU2MWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/0993ebd92e5e3815616052e454b46caa457c4aaa","sha":"0993ebd92e5e3815616052e454b46caa457c4aaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/0993ebd92e5e3815616052e454b46caa457c4aaa"}],"sha":"652973bdd626c94c34da096eface684c6ccee61e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/652973bdd626c94c34da096eface684c6ccee61e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clone-fan","id":168186446,"login":"clone-fan","node_id":"U_kgDOCgZSTg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/0993ebd92e5e3815616052e454b46caa457c4aaa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T19:36:49Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T19:36:49Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"message":"AgentOpsAssistant 1.0.0 正式版\n\n整合五大移植功能 + 结构整顿，自审通过后发布。\n\n功能（均 UI 用本插件自有、未抄原插件界面）：\n- 自动删种（jxxghp TorrentRemover）\n- 插件自动更新（thsrite PluginAutoUpdate）\n- 订阅规则自动填充（thsrite SubscribeGroup）：下载填充 + 二级分类自定义填充\n  + 清理历史/已处理记录\n- 媒体库服务器通知（jxxghp MediaServerMsg）：webhook 播放/入库/登录等\n- 下载器助手（hotlcc DownloaderHelper）：活动种子概览 + 按站点批量打标签\n\n结构与体验：\n- 配置页一级分类扁平化 + 左侧分组（汇报中心/订阅与站点/下载与媒体/系统维护）\n- 每日汇报 = 聚合汇报中心：按栏目逐项开关（版本/站点状态/站点增量/今日下载/\n  入库整理/订阅追新/存储空间/媒体统计/今日摘要）\n- 站点状态逐站“站点名 | 状态”；下载器与今日下载去重；站点数据统计上仪表盘饼图\n- 统一 cron 为 VCronField\n\n质量自审：本地单测 90 项 + 发版自检（23 接口/6 服务/命令/生命周期完整性）\n+ pyflakes + 前端构建全绿；dist 哈希一致。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"83661358fffe8e711a8ef40e634ac5024ba10897","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/83661358fffe8e711a8ef40e634ac5024ba10897"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/0993ebd92e5e3815616052e454b46caa457c4aaa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clone-fan","id":168186446,"login":"clone-fan","node_id":"U_kgDOCgZSTg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/0993ebd92e5e3815616052e454b46caa457c4aaa","node_id":"C_kwDOTg5y1d