lone-fan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/ffe31244dc2a21d13f09e5da2fd0e3a7a0d9426d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T17:17:22Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T17:17:22Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"message":"AgentOpsAssistant v0.0.17：新增「媒体通知」一级分类（媒体库服务器通知）\n\n功能移植自 jxxghp/MediaServerMsg 核心（UI 用本插件自有配置页）：\n监听 Emby/Jellyfin/Plex 的 WebhookMessage 事件并按配置推送通知。\n\n- on_webhook_message：事件归类（新入库/开始播放/停止播放/登录成功/\n  登录失败/标记）→ 按所选类型与媒体服务器过滤 → 30 秒去重 → 构造\n  标题/正文/图标 → post_message(MediaServer)。\n- 暂不含原插件的剧集聚合/IP 定位/海报抓取（留待按需补强）。\n- 新增配置 msgnotify_enabled/types/servers；新增 /mediaservers 接口；\n  Config.vue 新增顶层「媒体通知」一级分类。\n- 测试：新增 11 项（事件归类/通知/去重/未勾选/未启用/服务器过滤），\n  全套 67 项全过；py_compile/pyflakes 通过；已 npm run build 重建 dist。\n- README 致谢补「媒体库服务器通知（jxxghp）」。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"efa88ee67ab7f0debc98736e6ae008ba6aa1779c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/efa88ee67ab7f0debc98736e6ae008ba6aa1779c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/ffe31244dc2a21d13f09e5da2fd0e3a7a0d9426d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/gists{/gist_id}","grav