o}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/7f6a96d39d45a9530b8cb2307644587001e2a2da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T16:36:01Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T16:36:01Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"message":"AgentOpsAssistant v0.0.16：新增「订阅规则自动填充」\n\n功能移植自 thsrite/SubscribeGroup 的下载填充（UI 用本插件自有\n「每日汇报·规则填充」页）：电视剧订阅下载到资源后，监听 DownloadAdded\n事件，用该资源实际规格自动回填订阅中“尚为空”的规则，锁定后续剧集追同款。\n\n- on_download_fill_subscribe：get_by_hash → 仅电视剧 → list_by_tmdbid →\n  _subfill_build_update（只填空不覆盖：分辨率/资源质量/特效/制作组/站点）\n  → SubscribeOper.update；按 type:tmdbid 去重只填一次。\n- _parse_pix/_parse_type/_parse_effect 规格→规则正则，verbatim 移植。\n- 新增配置 subfill_enabled/subfill_details/subfill_notify；Config.vue\n  「每日汇报」新增“规则填充”子页。\n- 测试：新增 11 项（解析器/填充逻辑/不覆盖/事件端到端/去重/非剧跳过），\n  全套 56 项全过；py_compile/pyflakes 通过；已 npm run build 重建 dist。\n- README 致谢补「订阅规则自动填充（thsrite）」。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b593aeff8857e8726806ab51ade6b6aecbf41c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/0b593aeff8857e8726806ab51ade6b6aecbf41c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/7f6a96d39d45a9530b8cb2307644587001e2a2da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"h