https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/2fe6ff811f4b162cefdf5ae0d8b6e5b1da083d39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T16:14:41Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T16:14:41Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"message":"AgentOpsAssistant v0.0.15：插件库更新增强——集成「插件自动更新」\n\n功能移植自 thsrite/PluginAutoUpdate（UI 用本插件自有「插件库」配置页）：\n在“插件库更新”里增加检测已安装插件新版，可选自动下载安装并重载。\n\n- _auto_update_installed_plugins：PluginManager().get_online_plugins()/\n  get_local_plugins() + SystemConfigOper().get(UserInstalledPlugins) 比对版本\n  → PluginHelper().install(pid, repo_url) → reload_plugin + update_plugin_job；\n  通知带 v旧→v新 + 该版本 history 更新记录。并入 run_market_update。\n- 新增配置：market_update_auto_install / install_ids / exclude_ids /\n  skip_running（Config.vue「插件库」面板新增“自动更新已安装插件”区）。\n- 安全默认：自动安装默认关闭（仅提醒）；本插件自身与 MoviePilot 本体永不\n  自动更新；正在运行的插件不升级。\n- 测试：新增 7 项（开关开/关、排除、自身保护、运行中跳过、带更新记录），\n  全套 45 项全过；py_compile/pyflakes 通过；已 npm run build 重建 dist。\n- README 致谢补「插件自动更新（thsrite）」。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf85c3e88e8dddde18e83a5f99e20f28455d48d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/bf85c3e88e8dddde18e83a5f99e20f28455d48d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/2fe6ff811f4b162cefdf5ae0d8b6e5b1da083d39","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https