ps://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/190bee9df699c99003d7e3f9c1cd8fc2f071b7d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T14:38:14Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T14:38:14Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"message":"AgentOpsAssistant v0.0.14：修复「插件残留清理」选了插件却没效果\n\n根因：清理逻辑 _build_plugin_uninstall_status 只读旧的单个\nself._plugin_uninstall_id，而配置页用的是多选 plugin_uninstall_ids；\n单 ID 恒为空 → 被当作“未填写ID”阻止 → 什么都不删（即“没效果”）。\n\n- 改为遍历多选列表（兼容旧单 ID），逐个插件汇总 候选/备份/删除/异常；\n  保留对 AgentOpsAssistant/MoviePilot 本体的禁止治理保护。\n- 顺带移除一处重复的 @staticmethod 装饰器。\n- 新增 4 项残留治理回归测试（多选识别、空目标不误删、本体保护、多 ID 合并）。\n  全套 py_compile/单测/pyflakes 通过；纯后端修复，无需重建 dist。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1be688e973c03016d01f8ae1cf2bb9aa1efcbef0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/1be688e973c03016d01f8ae1cf2bb9aa1efcbef0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/190bee9df699c99003d7e3f9c1cd8fc2f071b7d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clone-fan","id":168186446,"login":"clone-fan","node_id":"U_kgDOCgZSTg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/190bee9df699c99003d7e3f9c1cd8fc2f071b7d1","node_id":"C_kwDOTg5y1doAKDE5MGJlZTlkZjY5OWM5OTAwM2Q3ZTNmOWMxY2Q4ZmMyZjA3MWI3ZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/a6df89e77e4a97d20cd02da84a45d059763ae8a9","sha":"a6df89e77e4a97d20cd02da84a45d059763ae8a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/a6df89e77e4a97d20cd02da84a45d059763ae8a9"}],"sha":"190bee9df699c99003d7e3f9c1cd8fc2f071b7d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/190bee9df699c99003d7e3f9c1cd8fc2f071b7d1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clone-fan","id":168186446,"login":"clone-fan","node_id":"U_kgDOCgZSTg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/a6df89e77e4a97d20cd02da84a45d059763ae8a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T13:44:55Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T13:44:55Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"message":"AgentOpsAssistant v0.0.13：修复 PostgreSQL 备份报“异常” + 仪表盘补齐手动触发按钮\n\n- 备份：容器内缺 pg_dump 不再判为失败。先在 PATH 与常见目录查 pg_dump；\n  找不到则用 MoviePilot 自带 SQLAlchemy 引擎兜底导出（CREATE TABLE + INSERT，\n  _sql_literal 转义防坏 SQL）；仍不行则降级为“提示”而非“异常”，配置文件备份\n  照常成功。备份状态文案区分 异常 / 提示。\n- 仪表盘「手动触发」补齐：检查更新 / 插件库更新 / 自动删种（落实“凡可手动\n  触发的功能都在仪表盘放按钮”的项目规矩）。\n- 测试：tests/run_local_tests.py 新增 _sql_literal 转义、无 pg_dump 优雅兜底、\n  异常/提示状态文案断言（合计 34 项全过）。已 npm run build 重建 dist。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e19615b29667d507fbb6d2574aa42e11322cc11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/3e19615b29667d507fbb6d2574aa42e11322cc11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/a6df89e77e4a97d20cd02da84a45d059763ae8a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clone-fan","id":168186446,"login":"clone-fan","node_id":"U_kgDOCgZSTg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/a6df89e77e4a97d20cd02da84a45d059763ae8a9","node_id":"C_kwDOTg5y1doAKGE2ZGY4OWU3N2U0YTk3ZDIwY2QwMmRhODRhNDVkMDU5NzYzYWU4YTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/3dda182bbd127c6a3be2ceb222f05226796e66cb","sha":"3dda182bbd127c6a3be2ceb222f05226796e66cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/3dda182bbd127c6a3be2ceb222f05226796e66cb"}],"sha":"a6df89e77e4a97d20cd02da84a45d059763ae8a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/a6df89e77e4a97d20cd02da84a45d059763ae8a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clone-fan","id":168186446,"login":"clone-fan","node_id":"U_kgDOCgZSTg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/3dda182bbd127c6a3be2ceb222f05226796e66cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T12:15:24Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T12:15:24Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"message":"AgentOpsAssistant v0.0.12：新增「种子治理·自动删种」（功能移植，UI 用自有配置页）\n\n把 jxxghp「自动删种」TorrentRemover 的功能逻辑搬进本插件（不抄其 UI）：\n- 后端：按 大小/分享率/做种时间/平均上传速度/标签/保存路径/Tracker/任务状态(QB)/\n  错误信息(TR)/分类 条件，定时在所选下载器执行 暂停/删除种子/删除种子和文件；\n  支持处理辅种、仅 MoviePilot 任务、结果通知；做种时长按 now−completion_on(QB)/\n  date_done(TR) 计算。注册 get_service/get_api(/run_seed_clean,/downloaders)/\n  命令/仪表盘任务行。安全默认：默认停用、动作默认暂停、无任何条件则跳过不处理。\n- 前端：Config.vue 新增「种子治理」主标签 + 自动删种面板（本插件自有风格），\n  下载器下拉走 /downloaders；已 npm run build 重建 dist。\n- 测试：新增 tests/run_local_tests.py，桩掉 app.*/apscheduler 本地跑删种匹配/\n  守卫/端到端（26 项断言全过）；新开发流程 py_compile→单测→pyflakes→build→推送。\n- 顺手清理 _format_backup_status_text 一处无占位符 f-string。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d2594458b92f48db17ed100ef0cb93d09211c94e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/d2594458b92f48db17ed100ef0cb93d09211c94e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/3dda182bbd127c6a3be2ceb222f05226796e66cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clone-fan","id":168186446,"login":"clone-fan","node_id":"U_kgDOCgZSTg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/