one"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T11:02:55Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"message":"AgentOpsAssistant v0.0.11：日报修复——存储去“已配置”噪声 + 今日下载改入库口径\n\n- 存储空间：与官方仪表盘 _build_storage 同口径，仅展示能取到真实用量的存储；\n  取不到用量的（未真正配置/不支持用量查询）不再写成“xxx：已配置”噪声行。\n- 今日下载：改以今日入库(转移历史 list_by_date)成功记录为准，按“剧名·季集”\n  展示当天下载入库内容；用 download_hash 命中下载器种子，按完成时间\n  (对齐官方“自动删种”口径 now−completion_on/date_done)算做种时长互相印证，\n  显示“（做种：Xh）”。删除原先与今日无关、易误解的“做种中：N 个”计数。\n- 入库整理段不再重复罗列标题，仅保留今日成功/失败概览。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c52183fc0aa75cb34df55fada40ae9d71c54805","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/6c52183fc0aa75cb34df55fada40ae9d71c54805"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/bb63b612817af0ef3d4b7ef00d0a0a7955a3708a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clone-fan","id":168186446,"login":"clone-fan","node_id":"U_kgDOCgZSTg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/bb63b612817af0ef3d4b7ef00d0a