"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T12:57:58Z","email":"clone_fan@foxmail.com","name":"clone"},"message":"@\n发布 0.0.4：每日汇报自定义称呼 + 修复 7 项配置页问题\n\n- 新增「汇报称呼」输入框，可替换汇报开头与提醒中对用户的称呼（默认少爷）\n- 消除健康巡查摘要重复开关：日报开关归基础设置，健康巡查归健康页签\n- 全部 cron 字段统一改用 VCronField（日报/日志/备份/MP更新）\n- 根治切换一级分类二级页签不跳首项：全部 VWindowItem 常驻渲染，仅切 activeSub\n- 合并插件残留清理两个二级页签为单页，加预览/执行按钮\n- 日志清理「限定插件」改为已安装插件下拉多选\n- 订阅提醒/站点统计开关与日报包含开关分离，消除冗余\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n@","tree":{"sha":"a79e842f03ba65b7eeba91f46dd863a01a5e5dab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/a79e842f03ba65b7eeba91f46dd863a01a5e5dab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/ed5ed36ecea2c8aab4aa825e7d01be9b484e1300","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168186446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clone-fan","id":168186446,"login":"clone-fan","node_id":"U_kgDOCgZSTg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clone-fan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zhl-eman/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/ed5ed36ecea2c8aab4aa825e7d01be9b484e1300","node_id":"C_kwDOTg5y1doAKGVkNWVkMzZlY2VhMmM4YWFiNGF