epo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swoyambhushrestha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swoyambhushrestha","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nabinghimire-png/pension-prototype/commits/96ef40cc902ff0076b74e0e18a2094d16768a81d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T12:24:48Z","email":"swoyambhushrestha@vivekahealth.com","name":"swoyambhu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T12:24:48Z","email":"swoyambhushrestha@vivekahealth.com","name":"swoyambhu"},"message":"fix: label linked participant correctly in AP QDRO waterfall\n\nOn an Alternate Payee''s member page the pension estimate is redirected to\nthe linked primary participant''s credits, but the QDRO waterfall still\ntreated the page member as \"the participant\" and never consumed\nlinkedParticipantMemberId. This mislabeled the AP as \"(Participant)\" and\nleft the real participant/alternate payees unresolved as \"Member {id}\".\n\n- MemberDetail: add collectQdroNameIds() unioning the page member''s QDRO-\n  order APs, the estimate''s allocation APs, and (when redirected) the\n  linked participant id, so every id shown in the waterfall resolves to a\n  name; wire it into both name-map build sites.\n- MemberDetail: resolve participantName from linkedParticipantMemberId when\n  estimatedFromLinkedParticipant is true; page member otherwise (participant\n  view unchanged).\n- Tests: unit-test collectQdroNameIds, assert the participant row shows the\n  linked participant (not the AP) and name-resolution covers the right ids,\n  and cover the QdroWaterfall \"Member {id}\" fallback.","tree":{"sha":"43bf9881d21096e72adb65aa7499ee5ddfe8525c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nabinghimire-png/pension-prototype/git/trees/43bf9881d21096e72adb65aa7499ee5ddfe8525c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nabinghimire-png/pension-prototype/git/commits/96ef40cc902ff0076b74e0e18a2094d16768a81d","verification":{"payload":n