.com","name":"sakshiviveka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T06:57:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"IN-724: add pre-commit CI pipeline with GitHub Actions workflow and hooks config (#36)\n\n* IN-724: add pre-commit CI pipeline with GitHub Actions workflow and hooks config\n\n* IN-724: use npm install --legacy-peer-deps, remove npm cache requirement\n\n* IN-724: run pre-commit checks on pull request only, target dev/preprod/production\n\n* IN-724: bump CI action versions and pre-commit-hooks rev\n\nUpdate actions/checkout, setup-python, setup-node to latest majors,\nbump Python to 3.13, and pre-commit-hooks to v6.0.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* IN-724: remove --fail-fast from pre-commit action\n\nLet all hooks run and report, instead of stopping at first failure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Ujjwal Sapkota <ujjwalsapkota@vivekahealth.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a4d866837c6d9f291cbacdcf131ebb2f1284d6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nabinghimire-png/pension-prototype/git/trees/7a4d866837c6d9f291cbacdcf131ebb2f1284d6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nabinghimire-png/pension-prototype/git/commits/93ec1f3e9c199fec9ea21f9cf522d17701591d25","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a4d866837c6d9f291cbacdcf131ebb2f1284d6d\nparent 3f027cae566095557c9dac56006aaa8f8b30c4ca\nauthor sakshiviveka <sakshichaudhary@vivekahealth.com> 1783666665 +0545\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783666665 +0545\n\nIN-724: add pre-commit CI pipeline with GitHub Actions workflow and hooks config (#36)\n\n* IN-724: add pre-commit CI pipeline with GitHub Actions workflow and hooks config\n\n* IN-724: use npm install --legacy-peer-deps, remove npm cache requirement\n\n* IN-724: run pre-commit checks on pull request only, target dev/preprod/production\n\n* IN-724: bump CI action versions and pre-commit-hooks rev\n\nUpdate actions/checkout, setup-python, setup-node to latest majors,\nbump Python to 3.13, and pre-commit-hooks to v6.0.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* IN-724: remove --fail-fast from pre-commit action\n\nLet all hooks run and report, instead of stopping at first failure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Ujjwal Sapkota <ujjwalsapkota@vivekahealth.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUJfpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHeQQAFdqVrhB06HacM9DOxwcEDdB\nYtB2VhtKG1r6Izhg0KhY1Jt1fQrRu0KKVSpd8qjNrumC9K1sPSGw+Meom3x2NGlH\nD+hOIpEj06VCj0vzk1eG5L0P/z6mXpUxNdWvm2CxKmkUv3omsUA5Hosp1wl5Pb1f\n+YWVN7aIKOJ3tTrVc58OWeSGTSUEq453Lia9l5IGGx7+LcEfrhzH0xFz2dLFebKt\nLmv6TON4kRGrcSdmwebUqTk4WkFt3fobgIfjPOHgbUCRQgbJJYxHO9Sl7KsHPJ0J\n2DykGyvXKpcjbRGLy3D5cHussN3RmTknW0gmo4wjFhyAeujSBK5cN8cEkkOGDGT5\nAwPIXFyj/gql58WVeZzkdVdLjX5DrkVLPJ0hTXZydmabKUwScezU6vWskvjPgWko\nnY6O/sJFetwfwJvxRp6k0/d+4FN2Jf2GbR/z/vvHhQDjLsSws5FIVOBP4xDLUwXl\npVUTCRhw0F+Pnb+u8OSdkp5m0upRfkznPrK4s4V4EXiFLh8s/FofJmejxhODQSnF\nd6YrzbDQ/S++186cgtIRUQCdcZZpO/uThx/XAki/0iDQ3lolBP4sttuBJvVgkshX\nT4m8I1oixvXz7GocxslR+5G1JZTpc6XKRXBC/RCFN8R/x9kcd8qgjyFCmrCkQl9H\n47lahcyR7SSaSaGR84Aw\n=F31/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-23T06:33:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":