ub.com/repos/nabinghimire-png/pension-prototype/commits/d9e14695f8406a0031f60a67bac2021486ad7aea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T09:35:12Z","email":"swoyambhushrestha@vivekahealth.com","name":"swoyambhu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T09:35:12Z","email":"swoyambhushrestha@vivekahealth.com","name":"swoyambhu"},"message":"feat: handle Beneficiary/Alternate Payee display and reduce redundant member fetches\n- MemberDetail.tsx: hide Work History tab and Pension Summary Statement action for Beneficiary/Alternate Payee members; show a banner on the Pension Estimator when the estimate is derived from a linked participant''s credits (estimatedFromLinkedParticipant)\n- MemberList.tsx: blank Hire Date and show a participant-value info tooltip on the Industry/Credits/Vested column headers when the selected category is Beneficiary or Alternate Payee, driven by the UI''s own category selection rather than per-row backend status\n- MemberDetail.tsx/MemberList.tsx: skip the redundant GET /members/{id} call on drill-down from the list by passing the already-fetched row via router state; fall back to fetching detail fresh when state is absent (e.g. hard refresh)\n- memberService.ts: map ''alternate_payee'' API status to ''Alternate Payee'' (previously unmapped)\n- pensionEstimationService.ts: add estimatedFromLinkedParticipant and linkedParticipantMemberId to the PensionEstimate type\n- documentsService.ts/MemberDetail.tsx: add PENSION_STATEMENT as a Documents tab filter option; remove the unused SUMMARY_STATEMENT type that was never produced by the backend\n- Add/extend tests: memberService, MemberList, MemberDetail","tree":{"sha":"e376bbbd781088b3996d689e990f26847082dc28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nabinghimire-png/pension-prototype/git/trees/e376bbbd781088b3996d689e990f26847082dc28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nabinghimire-png/pension-prototype/git/commits/d9e14695f8406a0031f60a67bac2021486ad7aea","verification":{"payload":nu