onMethod union to catch silent typo mismatches at compile time\n- Log failed member name lookups in batchResolveMemberNames so a down name service is distinguishable from a legitimate missing record\n- Log real error cause when estimate refresh fails after a QDRO mutation\n- Align debounced estimate params with buildEstimateParams (survivorOption, maritalStatus, expectedHoursPerYear handling)\n- Clarify priority reorder error to communicate partial application risk\n- Surface actual QdroServiceError message in eligible-AP load failure\n- Add UNDER_LEGAL_REVIEW → Terminate to QdroStatusMenu JSDoc\n- Remove useless member ternary at QdroWaterfall participantName prop","tree":{"sha":"9d632419d6bcb6028b6ac6afb0465fc44acdebd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nabinghimire-png/pension-prototype/git/trees/9d632419d6bcb6028b6ac6afb0465fc44acdebd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nabinghimire-png/pension-prototype/git/commits/47a45da04b23405d7fbc36714708ad267a27b937","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267578781?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swoyambhushrestha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swoyambhushrestha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swoyambhushrestha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swoyambhushrestha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/swoyambhushrestha","id":267578781,"login":"swoyambhushrestha","node_id":"U_kgDOD_LtnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swoyambhushrestha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swoyambhushrestha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swoyambhushrestha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swoyambhushrestha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/