thor":{"date":"2026-06-16T09:16:36Z","email":"swoyambhushrestha@vivekahealth.com","name":"swoyambhu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T09:16:36Z","email":"swoyambhushrestha@vivekahealth.com","name":"swoyambhu"},"message":"fix: address QDRO code review findings\n\n- Reset file state on dialog close to prevent stale court order document from being silently re-uploaded on the next submission\n- Add AbortController to getEligibleAlternatePayees fetch to prevent stale response from a prior participant populating the wrong AP list\n- Disable Allocation Method select for ACTIVE QDROs in edit mode, matching the disabled guard already on the numeric allocation inputs\n- Add UNDER_LEGAL_REVIEW to canTerminate so in-review orders can be terminated from the UI (e.g. participant death during review)\n- Replace toISOString() with formatDateForAPI() for local-timezone-correct date comparison in the future-effective QDRO warning\n- Add AbortSignal support to getQdroOrders so it can be cancelled on unmount alongside the other three fetches in the initial Promise.all\n- Add reordering in-flight guard to QdroPanel to prevent concurrent priority mutations from a rapid double-click","tree":{"sha":"81780b873b42b9f75abc876002d6a43dc874028f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nabinghimire-png/pension-prototype/git/trees/81780b873b42b9f75abc876002d6a43dc874028f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nabinghimire-png/pension-prototype/git/commits/2a3498eacb9b06829c733f3a55d8d64841d62da2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267578781?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swoyambhushrestha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swoyambhushrestha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swoyambhushrestha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swoyambhushrestha/gists{