n\n- Add Dockerfile.base (node:20.12.0-alpine + pnpm@10.4.1) and\n  build-base-image.yml workflow triggered on Dockerfile.base changes\n- Update build-and-deploy.yml with workflow_run trigger, paths-ignore,\n  and ECR_REGISTRY build-arg so main build uses the base image\n- Update Dockerfile to FROM the ECR base image via ARG ECR_REGISTRY\n- Remove .bckp files\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: hardcode AWS region and account ID in workflows\n\nvars.AWS_REGION and vars.AWS_ACCOUNT_ID are not configured in the repo;\nuse hardcoded us-east-1 / 501610556844 via env block instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: fix ECR repo name for base image to use integration path\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: restore pnpm-lock.yaml required by Dockerfile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: remove build-and-deploy workflow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: add build.yml main workflow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: fix values file names to match platform-playbook\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: rebase before push in gitops-update to avoid conflicts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* IN-704: add dev environment and refactor build workflows\n\n- Add dev environment config pointing to dev.vivekahealth.com\n- Update Dockerfile default VITE_ENV to dev\n- Replace build.yml with docker-build.yaml targeting dev and IN-704 only\n- Align build-base-image.yml to use secrets.AWS_ROLE_ARN and vars.AWS_REGION\n- Add workflow_run trigger to build after base image update\n- Use values-integration.yaml for gitops update with web namespace\n\n* IN-704: use SLACK_WEBHOOK_INTEGRATION org secret for Slack notifications\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: sajana <sajanashakya@vivekahealth.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a7d0d78655c5f3d32ed508dc18fb4aae5af5132","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nabinghimire-png/pension-prototype/git/trees/1a7d0d78655c5f3d32ed508dc18fb4aae5af5132"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nabinghimire-png/pension-prototype/git/commits/9b286b6760dd7c87246ee3c247604554a725667f","verification":{"payload":"tree 1a7d0d78655c5f3d32ed508dc18fb4aae5af5132\nparent 58257d1156010fb3c5dc715eaf1b94f34d02b9f1\nauthor sakshiviveka <sakshichaudhary@vivekahealth.com> 1780642680 +0545\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780642680 +0545\n\nAdded build workflow and added build enviroment dev (points to dev.vivekahealth.com) (#32)\n\n* create backup pnpm-lock.yaml.bckp\n\n* move pipeline to bckp file\n\n* ci: add build & deploy workflows based on Validator pattern\n\nSplit monolithic pipeline into build-and-deploy.yml, gitops-update.yml,\nand slack-notify.yml reusable workflows; upgrade action versions to v6/v7.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: add base image workflow and Dockerfile.base, remove backups\n\n- Add Dockerfile.base (node:20.12.0-alpine + pnpm@10.4.1) and\n  build-base-image.yml workflow triggered on Dockerfile.base changes\n- Update build-and-deploy.yml with workflow_run trigger, paths-ignore,\n  and ECR_REGISTRY build-arg so main build uses the base image\n- Update Dockerfile to FROM the ECR base image via ARG ECR_REGISTRY\n- Remove .bckp files\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: hardcode AWS region and account ID in workflows\n\nvars.AWS_REGION and vars.AWS_ACCOUNT_ID are not configured in the repo;\nuse hardcoded us-east-1 / 501610556844 via env block instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: fix ECR repo name for base image to use integration path\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: restore pnpm-lock.yaml required by Dockerfile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: remove build-and-deploy workflow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: add build.yml main workflow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: fix values file names to match platform-playbook\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: rebase before push in gitops-update to avoid conflicts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* IN-704: add dev environment and refactor build workflows\n\n- Add dev environment config pointing to dev.vivekahealth.com\n- Update Dockerfile default VITE_ENV to dev\n- Replace build.yml with docker-build.yaml targeting dev and IN-704 only\n- Align build-base-image.yml to use secrets.AWS_ROLE_ARN and vars.AWS_REGION\n- Add workflow_run trigger to build after base image update\n- Use values-integration.yaml for gitops update with web namespace\n\n* IN-704: use SLACK_WEBHOOK_INTEGRATION org secret for Slack notifications\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: sajana <sajanashakya@vivekahealth.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqInN4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACykQAFEA83AWVZM/MCEQeUlVMypY\nH3jGDg9UYuSukubj6UgZAcfy99vNAlX0Q7wxA8UyrhIms98Lox6XfPd0BlGvEdw9\n+uDxhr2Rd81Ju0TgDS75mFycO4kIz8XSJU9PlreBhWlPmJyWXU2sd9HWhyOEZPDb\npyour4qs9NYouw1QGRomRMAanv+X+z6nF2wauHDqDWaCQrfkiBjrCIwY2TKVYtFq\nR++B1MoNOq3IrTdgBawfI1R/tbRGsmb9hdk/j1psxi14Q1lO5N1CsxeFpkjaNU5F\ngjorHFR4jyaBQAgxhMxAlkGoduv2sPxFWS/LdV/k4Lf6EUUYTP4f87/AqRJ+oGpk\nvS2XWc8w+0Kz0eXlM1DxXDRc4lYx0CMWJTUd/DAom9/e1xjSbJrkVm1Y9cvJkttF\neiTKp8ydGf2qRvO4AGP6ZTrYXAT07oOfjdzSPThCxclZTAsP/RuYaLgO8UAqQqCE\nrc/2REAWMbmxfaCVaJCpErsOYraLnC3QOD8YobJSA2RhKIwWSABTA0L0ebMmvom6\nSNlU0ogZxb/zr//Avz2w/K+OUD5FqEzUcTHBMzls7jHCVZiuedVbQa7ZUYxDfkH5\nbKPWGcL9aDNMkwo6dc1YMmsjNsmiAkijCxbud25a0EwxYgXD6gl2wM42nebhyU6H\nZCM8xBdkTDSg0NhMo1j+\n=SZYy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified