://api.github.com/users/swoyambhushrestha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swoyambhushrestha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swoyambhushrestha","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nabinghimire-png/pension-prototype/commits/a9ee35449eff1d7fce00c466decb86d1a9a3266e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T16:00:16Z","email":"swoyambhushrestha@vivekahealth.com","name":"swoyambhu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T16:00:16Z","email":"swoyambhushrestha@vivekahealth.com","name":"swoyambhu"},"message":"ELG-3693: Add accrual rate and hours-to-credits editing with the audit log tab\n\n          Adds row-level add/edit actions to the Accrual Rates and Hours to Credits\n          tables in Plan Configuration, along with a new Audit tab showing paginated\n          change history per plan.\n\n          - AccrualRateDialog: add/edit accrual rate rows with pension type select, rate_per_credit validation (0.01–999.99), effective date range validation, and required change_reason capture\n          - HoursToCreditsDialog: add/edit conversion rows supporting Fixed (pension credit) and Formula (expression + precision + rounding) modes, with min/max hours range validation and effective date range validation\n          - Both dialogs use fetch-before-save to prevent concurrent edit overwrites, matching rows by field identity rather than array index\n          - planConfigService: typed service functions for GET/PUT accrual-rates, hours-to-credits, and GET audit; generic ConfigurationApiResponse<T>; removed _warnings side-channel\n          - PlanConfiguration: Audit tab with paginated entries showing config type, version transition (vN-1 → vN), change reason, user, and timestamp; silent refresh after dialog saves to avoid full-page skeleton flash","tree":{"sha":"a7d76c9f5863858b32827995f820a41f4bdeca1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nabinghimire-pn